SELECT 'g7', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'ESSAY', '已知线段 $AB = 12\\text{ cm}$，点 $C$ 是直线 $AB$ 上一点，且 $BC = 4\\text{ cm}$，$M$、$N$ 分别是 $AB$、$BC$ 的中点，求线段 $MN$ 的长度。', '[]', '{"text":"解：\\n因为 $M$、$N$ 分别是 $AB$、$BC$ 的中点，所以 $MB = \\\\frac{1}{2}AB = 6\\\\text{ cm}$，$NB = \\\\frac{1}{2}BC = 2\\\\text{ cm}$。\\n分两种情况讨论：\\n① 当点 $C$ 在线段 $AB$ 上时，$MN = MB - NB = 6 - 2 = 4\\\\text{ cm}$；\\n② 当点 $C$ 在线段 $AB$ 的延长线上时，$MN = MB + NB = 6 + 2 = 8\\\\text{ cm}$。\\n综上，线段 $MN$ 的长度为 $4\\\\text{ cm}$ 或 $8\\\\text{ cm}$。"}', '【得分要点】注意“直线 $AB$ 上一点”未限定在线段内，必须分 $C$ 在线段内与延长线上两种情况讨论，求得 $4\\text{ cm}$ 或 $8\\text{ cm}$。', NULL, NULL, 3, '["双中点分类讨论","手写解答","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"线段与中点示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"line","x1":36,"y1":108,"x2":284,"y2":108,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"point","x":54,"y":108,"label":"A","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"point","x":148,"y":108,"label":"M","color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":198,"y":108,"label":"C","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":266,"y":108,"label":"B","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":54,"y1":96,"x2":54,"y2":120,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":266,"y1":96,"x2":266,"y2":120,"color":"#1E293B"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 104, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
