SELECT 'g7', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '钟表上 $8$ 点 $30$ 分时，时针与分针所成的较小夹角为（  ）', '["$75^\\\\circ$","$60^\\\\circ$","$90^\\\\circ$","$105^\\\\circ$"]', '{"index":0}', '分针指向 $6$（即 $180^\\circ$），时针在 $8$ 与 $9$ 正中间（$8 \\times 30^\\circ + 15^\\circ = 255^\\circ$），夹角为 $255^\\circ - 180^\\circ = 75^\\circ$。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["钟面角","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"钟表 8:30 时针与分针夹角","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"circle","cx":160,"cy":108,"r":74,"color":"#1E293B","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"line","x1":160,"y1":34,"x2":160,"y2":42,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":234,"y1":108,"x2":226,"y2":108,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":160,"y1":182,"x2":160,"y2":174,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":86,"y1":108,"x2":94,"y2":108,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":101.9762979464426,"y1":141.5,"x2":95.91412011995153,"y2":145,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"arc","cx":160,"cy":108,"r":34,"startAngle":90,"sweepAngle":75,"color":"#D97706","fillColor":"#FBBF24"},{"type":"arrow","x1":160,"y1":108,"x2":160,"y2":166,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"arrow","x1":160,"y1":108,"x2":119.43111529585914,"y2":118.87039989430588,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":160,"y":108,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":152,"y":16,"text":"12","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":240,"y":102,"text":"3","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":156,"y":186,"text":"6","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":70,"y":102,"text":"9","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":78,"y":142,"text":"8","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":114,"y":134,"text":"?","color":"#DC2626"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 102, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
