SELECT 'g7', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'ESSAY', '已知 $\\angle AOB = 100^\\circ$，射线 $OC$ 从 $OA$ 出发绕点 $O$ 以每秒 $5^\\circ$ 的速度逆时针旋转至 $OB$（不超出范围），$OM$ 平分 $\\angle AOC$，$ON$ 平分 $\\angle BOC$。\n(1) 当旋转时间 $t = 8$ 秒时，求 $\\angle AOC$ 与 $\\angle MON$ 的度数；\n(2) 试说明在 $OC$ 旋转过程中 $\\angle MON$ 的大小是否发生变化？并说明理由。', '[]', '{"text":"解：\\n(1) 当 $t = 8$ 秒时，$\\\\angle AOC = 5 \\\\times 8 = 40^\\\\circ$，则 $\\\\angle BOC = 100^\\\\circ - 40^\\\\circ = 60^\\\\circ$。\\n因为 $OM$、$ON$ 分别平分 $\\\\angle AOC$ 和 $\\\\angle BOC$，所以 $\\\\angle MOC = 20^\\\\circ$，$\\\\angle NOC = 30^\\\\circ$，\\n故 $\\\\angle MON = 20^\\\\circ + 30^\\\\circ = 50^\\\\circ$。\\n(2) $\\\\angle MON$ 的大小不发生变化，恒为 $50^\\\\circ$。\\n理由：$\\\\angle MON = \\\\angle MOC + \\\\angle NOC = \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\angle AOC + \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\angle BOC = \\\\frac{1}{2}(\\\\angle AOC + \\\\angle BOC) = \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\angle AOB = 50^\\\\circ$。"}', '【得分要点】正确算出 $t=8$ 时 $\\angle AOC=40^\\circ$，并写出利用角平分线合角证明 $\\angle MON = \\frac{1}{2}\\angle AOB = 50^\\circ$ 的规范推理过程。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["动角与双角平分线","几何推理","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"角与角平分线示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":58,"y1":162,"x2":272,"y2":162,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"arrow","x1":58,"y1":162,"x2":232,"y2":42,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"arrow","x1":58,"y1":162,"x2":262,"y2":92,"color":"#DC2626","dashed":true},{"type":"arc","cx":58,"cy":162,"r":42,"startAngle":-35,"sweepAngle":17,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"arc","cx":58,"cy":162,"r":50,"startAngle":-18,"sweepAngle":18,"color":"#059669"},{"type":"point","x":58,"y":162,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":42,"y":164,"text":"O","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":236,"y":30,"text":"A","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":274,"y":166,"text":"B","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":266,"y":86,"text":"C(平分线)","color":"#DC2626"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 105, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
