SELECT 'g7', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'DYNAMIC_TEMPLATE', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '“猪蹄模型”：已知 $AB \\parallel CD$，点 $E$ 在 $AB$、$CD$ 之间且 $\\angle AEC$ 开口向左，若 $\\angle BAE = {{a}}^\\circ$，$\\angle DCE = {{b}}^\\circ$，则 $\\angle AEC =$（  ）度', '[]', '{"index":0}', '过点 $E$ 作 $EF \\parallel AB \\parallel CD$，由内错角相等得 $\\angle AEC = \\angle BAE + \\angle DCE = {{a}} + {{b}} = {{a+b}}^\\circ$。', NULL, '{"type":"PARAM_TEMPLATE","vars":{"a":[25,38],"b":[30,45]},"stemTpl":"“猪蹄模型”：已知 $AB \\\\parallel CD$，点 $E$ 在 $AB$、$CD$ 之间且 $\\\\angle AEC$ 开口向左，若 $\\\\angle BAE = {{a}}^\\\\circ$，$\\\\angle DCE = {{b}}^\\\\circ$，则 $\\\\angle AEC =$（  ）度","ansExpr":"a + b","wrongExprs":["180 - a - b","abs(a - b) + 1","360 - a - b"]}', 3, '["拐点猪蹄模型","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"平行线“猪蹄模型” (AB ∥ CD)","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"line","x1":44,"y1":44,"x2":276,"y2":44,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":44,"y1":168,"x2":276,"y2":168,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":188,"y1":44,"x2":118,"y2":106,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"line","x1":118,"y1":106,"x2":202,"y2":168,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"line","x1":74,"y1":106,"x2":220,"y2":106,"color":"#0284C7","dashed":true},{"type":"point","x":118,"y":106,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":44,"y":26,"text":"A","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":266,"y":26,"text":"B","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":44,"y":174,"text":"C","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":266,"y":174,"text":"D","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":98,"y":98,"text":"E","color":"#DC2626"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 103, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
