SELECT 'g7', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'ESSAY', '已知：$AB \\parallel CD$，直线 $EF$ 分别交 $AB$、$CD$ 于 $E$、$F$，$EG$ 平分 $\\angle BEF$ 交 $CD$ 于点 $G$，若 $\\angle EFG = 64^\\circ$，求 $\\angle EGF$ 的度数。', '[]', '{"text":"解：\\n因为 $AB \\\\parallel CD$，所以 $\\\\angle BEF + \\\\angle EFG = 180^\\\\circ$（两直线平行，同旁内角互补）。\\n又 $\\\\angle EFG = 64^\\\\circ$，故 $\\\\angle BEF = 180^\\\\circ - 64^\\\\circ = 116^\\\\circ$。\\n因为 $EG$ 平分 $\\\\angle BEF$，所以 $\\\\angle BEG = \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\angle BEF = 58^\\\\circ$。\\n又因为 $AB \\\\parallel CD$，所以 $\\\\angle EGF = \\\\angle BEG = 58^\\\\circ$（两直线平行，内错角相等）。"}', '【得分要点】正确写出同旁内角互补求出 $\\angle BEF=116^\\circ$、角平分线求出 $58^\\circ$，以及内错角相等的推理依据。', NULL, NULL, 3, '["平行线推理","手写解答","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"平行线与截线 (a ∥ b)","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"line","x1":36,"y1":62,"x2":284,"y2":62,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":36,"y1":148,"x2":284,"y2":148,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":108,"y1":22,"x2":212,"y2":188,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"arc","cx":133,"cy":62,"r":18,"startAngle":0,"sweepAngle":58,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"arc","cx":187,"cy":148,"r":18,"startAngle":-180,"sweepAngle":58,"color":"#059669"},{"type":"text","x":28,"y":56,"text":"a","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":28,"y":142,"text":"b","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":154,"y":68,"text":"∠1","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":146,"y":128,"text":"∠2","color":"#059669"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 104, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
