SELECT 'g7', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '“铅笔头模型”：已知 $AB \\parallel CD$，点 $P$ 在 $AB$、$CD$ 之间且折线向左侧凸出（$\\angle BAP$、$\\angle APC$、$\\angle PCD$ 为同侧内凹三拐角），则 $\\angle BAP + \\angle APC + \\angle PCD =$（  ）', '["$360^\\\\circ$","$180^\\\\circ$","$270^\\\\circ$","$540^\\\\circ$"]', '{"index":0}', '过 $P$ 作 $PQ \\parallel AB \\parallel CD$，形成两对同旁内角，和为 $180^\\circ + 180^\\circ = 360^\\circ$。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["铅笔头拐点模型","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"平行线“铅笔头模型” (AB ∥ CD)","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"line","x1":54,"y1":44,"x2":266,"y2":44,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":54,"y1":168,"x2":266,"y2":168,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":220,"y1":44,"x2":104,"y2":106,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"line","x1":104,"y1":106,"x2":220,"y2":168,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":104,"y":106,"label":"P","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":54,"y":26,"text":"A","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":258,"y":26,"text":"B","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":54,"y":174,"text":"C","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":258,"y":174,"text":"D","color":"#1E293B"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 101, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
