SELECT 'g7', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '《九章算术》记载：“今有鸡兔同笼，上有三十五头，下有九十四足，问鸡兔各几何？”设鸡 $x$ 只、兔 $y$ 只，列出的方程组是（  ）', '["$\\\\begin{cases} x + y = 35 \\\\\\\\ 2x + 4y = 94 \\\\end{cases}$","$\\\\begin{cases} x + y = 35 \\\\\\\\ 4x + 2y = 94 \\\\end{cases}$","$\\\\begin{cases} x + y = 94 \\\\\\\\ 2x + 4y = 35 \\\\end{cases}$","$\\\\begin{cases} 2x + 2y = 35 \\\\\\\\ x + y = 94 \\\\end{cases}$"]', '{"index":0}', '头数共 $35$，鸡 $2$ 足、兔 $4$ 足，脚数共 $94$，故选第一项。', NULL, NULL, 2, '["古代数学问题","TASK-20261122-002"]', NULL, 'ADMIN', 1, 102, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
