SELECT 'g7', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'DYNAMIC_TEMPLATE', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '若关于 $x$、$y$ 的方程组 $\\begin{cases} x + 2y = 4 \\\\ 2x + y = p \\end{cases}$ 的解满足 $x + y = {{a}}$，则 $p$ 的值为（  ）', '[]', '{"index":0}', '两式相加得 $3(x + y) = 4 + p$，将 $x+y = {{a}}$ 代入得 $p = 3\\times {{a}} - 4 = {{3*a-4}}$。', NULL, '{"type":"PARAM_TEMPLATE","vars":{"a":[3,7]},"stemTpl":"若关于 $x$、$y$ 的方程组 $\\\\begin{cases} x + 2y = 4 \\\\\\\\ 2x + y = p \\\\end{cases}$ 的解满足 $x + y = {{a}}$，则 $p$ 的值为（  ）","ansExpr":"3 * a - 4","wrongExprs":["3 * a + 4","a - 4","3 * a - 2"]}', 2, '["含参方程组","TASK-20261122-002"]', NULL, 'ADMIN', 1, 104, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
