SELECT 'g7', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '若关于 $x$ 的不等式组 $\\begin{cases} x - a \\ge 0 \\\\ 5 - 2x > 1 \\end{cases}$ 共有 $3$ 个整数解，则 $a$ 的取值范围是（  ）', '["$-2 < a \\\\le -1$","$-1 \\\\le a < 0$","$0 < a \\\\le 1$","$-1 < a \\\\le 0$"]', '{"index":0}', '由第二式得 $x < 2$，所以解集为 $a \\le x < 2$；要恰有 $3$ 个整数解，必定是 $1, 0, -1$，故 $-2 < a \\le -1$。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["整数解个数与端点等号","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"不等式组数轴公共解集示意","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":26,"y1":134,"x2":294,"y2":134,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"polygon","points":[[106,96],[218,96],[218,134],[106,134]],"color":"#0284C7","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"polyline","points":[[106,134],[106,96],[274,96]],"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"polyline","points":[[218,134],[218,76],[46,76]],"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"circle","cx":106,"cy":134,"r":4,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":218,"y":134,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":98,"y":146,"text":"a","color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"text","x":212,"y":146,"text":"b","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":134,"y":108,"text":"公共解集","color":"#0284C7"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 101, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
