SELECT 'g7', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '关于 $x$ 的不等式组 $\\begin{cases} x < m \\\\ x \\ge 2 \\end{cases}$ 无解，则 $m$ 的取值范围是（  ）', '["$m \\\\le 2$","$m < 2$","$m > 2$","$m \\\\ge 2$"]', '{"index":0}', '当 $m = 2$ 时，$x < 2$ 与 $x \\ge 2$ 没有公共部分，同样无解，故 $m \\le 2$。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["不等式组无解","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"不等式组数轴公共解集示意","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":26,"y1":134,"x2":294,"y2":134,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"polygon","points":[[106,96],[218,96],[218,134],[106,134]],"color":"#0284C7","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"polyline","points":[[106,134],[106,96],[274,96]],"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"polyline","points":[[218,134],[218,76],[46,76]],"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"circle","cx":106,"cy":134,"r":4,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":218,"y":134,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":98,"y":146,"text":"a","color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"text","x":212,"y":146,"text":"b","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":134,"y":108,"text":"公共解集","color":"#0284C7"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 102, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
