SELECT 'g8', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '下列条件中，不能判定两个三角形全等的是（  ）', '["$SSA$（两边和其中一边的对角对应相等）","$SAS$","$ASA$","$SSS$"]', '{"index":0}', '两个三角形全等的判定公理有 $SSS$、$SAS$、$ASA$、$AAS$（以及直角三角形的 $HL$），$SSA$ 不能保证全等。', NULL, NULL, 1, '["全等判定条件","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"全等三角形 △ABC ≅ △DEF","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"polygon","points":[[84,42],[32,164],[142,164]],"color":"#1E293B","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"polygon","points":[[228,42],[176,164],[286,164]],"color":"#0284C7","fillColor":"#34D399"},{"type":"text","x":78,"y":22,"text":"A","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":18,"y":166,"text":"B","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":144,"y":166,"text":"C","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":222,"y":22,"text":"D","color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"text","x":164,"y":166,"text":"E","color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"text","x":288,"y":166,"text":"F","color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"text","x":148,"y":102,"text":"≅","color":"#DC2626"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 101, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
