SELECT 'g8', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '在 $\\triangle ABC$ 中，高 $AD$ 和 $BE$ 交于点 $H$，且 $BH = AC$，则 $\\angle ABC$ 的度数是（  ）', '["$45^\\\\circ$ 或 $135^\\\\circ$","一定为 $45^\\\\circ$","$60^\\\\circ$","$30^\\\\circ$"]', '{"index":0}', '需注意 $\\triangle ABC$ 为锐角三角形时（$H$ 在内部）由 $\\triangle BHD \\cong \\triangle ACD$ 得 $AD=BD \\Rightarrow \\angle ABC=45^\\circ$；若为钝角三角形（$\\angle ABC$ 为钝角，$H$ 在外部）则 $\\angle ABC=135^\\circ$！', NULL, NULL, 4, '["双垂直与分类全等","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"△ABC 示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"polygon","points":[[148,32],[56,172],[264,172]],"color":"#1E293B","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"text","x":142,"y":12,"text":"A","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":40,"y":174,"text":"B","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":268,"y":174,"text":"C","color":"#1E293B"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 102, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
