SELECT 'g8', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '等腰三角形的一个内角是 $80^\\circ$，则它的底角度数是（  ）', '["$80^\\\\circ$ 或 $50^\\\\circ$","一定为 $50^\\\\circ$","一定为 $80^\\\\circ$","$40^\\\\circ$ 或 $50^\\\\circ$"]', '{"index":0}', '当 $80^\\circ$ 为底角时，底角就是 $80^\\circ$；当 $80^\\circ$ 为顶角时，底角为 $\\frac{180^\\circ-80^\\circ}{2} = 50^\\circ$。', NULL, NULL, 1, '["等腰三角形角分类","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"等腰三角形示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"polygon","points":[[160,26],[82,174],[238,174]],"color":"#1E293B","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"line","x1":160,"y1":26,"x2":160,"y2":174,"color":"#64748B","dashed":true},{"type":"text","x":154,"y":8,"text":"A","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":66,"y":176,"text":"B","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":242,"y":176,"text":"C","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":98,"y":96,"text":"腰","color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"text","x":206,"y":96,"text":"腰","color":"#0284C7"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 102, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
