SELECT 'g8', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '在 $\\triangle ABC$ 中，$AB = AC$，$\\angle A = 36^\\circ$，$BD$ 平分 $\\angle ABC$ 交 $AC$ 于点 $D$，则图中的等腰三角形共有（  ）个', '["$3$","$2$","$1$","$4$"]', '{"index":0}', '底角均 $72^\\circ$，平分后得 $\\angle ABD = \\angle DBC = 36^\\circ$、$\\angle BDC = 72^\\circ$，故 $\\triangle ABC$、$\\triangle ABD$、$\\triangle BCD$ 均为等腰三角形，共 $3$ 个。', NULL, NULL, 3, '["黄金三角形模型","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"等腰三角形示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"polygon","points":[[160,26],[82,174],[238,174]],"color":"#1E293B","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"line","x1":160,"y1":26,"x2":160,"y2":174,"color":"#64748B","dashed":true},{"type":"text","x":154,"y":8,"text":"A","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":66,"y":176,"text":"B","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":242,"y":176,"text":"C","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":98,"y":96,"text":"腰","color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"text","x":206,"y":96,"text":"腰","color":"#0284C7"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 102, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
