SELECT 'g8', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'ESSAY', '在 $\\triangle ABC$ 中，$AB = AC$，点 $D$ 在 $BC$ 边上，且 $AD = BD$，若 $\\angle DAC = 42^\\circ$，求 $\\angle B$ 的度数。', '[]', '{"text":"解：\\n设 $\\\\angle B = x$。\\n因为 $AD = BD$，所以 $\\\\angle BAD = \\\\angle B = x$。\\n因为 $AB = AC$，所以 $\\\\angle C = \\\\angle B = x$。\\n在 $\\\\triangle ABC$ 中，由三角形内角和定理得：\\n$\\\\angle B + \\\\angle C + \\\\angle BAD + \\\\angle DAC = 180^\\\\circ$，\\n即 $x + x + x + 42^\\\\circ = 180^\\\\circ$。\\n解得 $3x = 138^\\\\circ$，$x = 46^\\\\circ$。\\n所以 $\\\\angle B$ 的度数为 $46^\\\\circ$。"}', '【得分要点】设未知数利用等边对等角倒角列方程，计算准确得到 $46^\\circ$。', NULL, NULL, 3, '["等腰倒角方程","手写解答","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"△ABC 示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"polygon","points":[[148,32],[56,172],[264,172]],"color":"#1E293B","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"text","x":142,"y":12,"text":"A","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":40,"y":174,"text":"B","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":268,"y":174,"text":"C","color":"#1E293B"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 104, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
