SELECT 'g8', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'DYNAMIC_TEMPLATE', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '等边三角形 $ABC$ 中，$P$ 在 $BC$ 上且 $BP = {{a}}$，点 $Q$ 在射线 $BA$ 方向（实际取 $BC$ 延伸构造等边或 $30^\\circ$）：在 $\\text{Rt}\\triangle ABC$ 中，$\\angle C=90^\\circ$，$\\angle B=30^\\circ$，作 $AB$ 的垂直平分线交 $BC$ 于 $D$，若 $CD = {{a}}$，则 $BD$ 的长为（  ）', '[]', '{"index":0}', '连接 $AD$，由垂直平分线得 $AD=BD$，故 $\\angle DAB = \\angle B = 30^\\circ$，从而 $\\angle CAD = 30^\\circ$，在 $\\text{Rt}\\triangle ACD$ 中 $AD = 2CD = {{2*a}}$，即 $BD = {{2*a}}$。', NULL, '{"type":"PARAM_TEMPLATE","vars":{"a":[4,10]},"stemTpl":"等边三角形 $ABC$ 中，$P$ 在 $BC$ 上且 $BP = {{a}}$，点 $Q$ 在射线 $BA$ 方向（实际取 $BC$ 延伸构造等边或 $30^\\\\circ$）：在 $\\\\text{Rt}\\\\triangle ABC$ 中，$\\\\angle C=90^\\\\circ$，$\\\\angle B=30^\\\\circ$，作 $AB$ 的垂直平分线交 $BC$ 于 $D$，若 $CD = {{a}}$，则 $BD$ 的长为（  ）","ansExpr":"2 * a","wrongExprs":["a","3 * a","a + 2"]}', 4, '["垂直平分线与30度角","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"线段垂直平分线性质","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"line","x1":58,"y1":158,"x2":262,"y2":158,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":160,"y1":24,"x2":160,"y2":186,"color":"#DC2626","dashed":true},{"type":"line","x1":160,"y1":56,"x2":58,"y2":158,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"line","x1":160,"y1":56,"x2":262,"y2":158,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"rightAngle","vx":160,"vy":158,"ax":160,"ay":56,"bx":262,"by":158,"size":10,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":160,"y":56,"label":"P","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":42,"y":160,"text":"A","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":266,"y":160,"text":"B","color":"#1E293B"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 103, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
