SELECT 'g8', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'ESSAY', '如图，点 $O$ 是等边 $\\triangle ABC$ 内一点，$\\angle AOB = 110^\\circ$，$\\angle BOC = \\alpha$。将 $\\triangle BOC$ 绕点 $C$ 按顺时针方向旋转 $60^\\circ$ 得 $\\triangle ADC$，连接 $OD$。\n(1) 试判断 $\\triangle COD$ 的形状，并说明理由；\n(2) 当 $\\alpha = 150^\\circ$ 时，试判断 $\\triangle AOD$ 的形状并求出各内角度数。', '[]', '{"text":"解：\\n(1) $\\\\triangle COD$ 是等边三角形。\\n理由：由旋转性质得 $CD = CO$，且旋转角 $\\\\angle OCD = 60^\\\\circ$，有一个角是 $60^\\\\circ$ 的等腰三角形是等边三角形。\\n(2) 由旋转知 $\\\\triangle ADC \\\\cong \\\\triangle BOC$，所以 $\\\\angle ADC = \\\\angle BOC = 150^\\\\circ$。\\n因为 $\\\\triangle COD$ 是等边三角形，所以 $\\\\angle ODC = 60^\\\\circ$，$\\\\angle DOC = 60^\\\\circ$。\\n因此 $\\\\angle ADO = \\\\angle ADC - \\\\angle ODC = 150^\\\\circ - 60^\\\\circ = 90^\\\\circ$。\\n又周角内 $\\\\angle AOC = 360^\\\\circ - 110^\\\\circ - 150^\\\\circ = 100^\\\\circ$，\\n所以 $\\\\angle AOD = \\\\angle AOC - \\\\angle DOC = 100^\\\\circ - 60^\\\\circ = 40^\\\\circ$，\\n$\\\\angle OAD = 180^\\\\circ - 90^\\\\circ - 40^\\\\circ = 50^\\\\circ$。\\n故 $\\\\triangle AOD$ 是直角三角形，三个内角分别为 $90^\\\\circ, 50^\\\\circ, 40^\\\\circ$。"}', '【得分要点】正确利用 $60^\\circ$ 旋转构造等边 $\\triangle COD$，准确计算 $\\angle ADO = 90^\\circ$ 与 $\\angle AOD = 40^\\circ$。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["旋转构全等","费马点入门","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"等边三角形旋转模型","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"polygon","points":[[155,24],[72,172],[238,172]],"color":"#1E293B","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"polygon","points":[[155,24],[238,172],[282,82]],"color":"#0284C7","fillColor":"#34D399"},{"type":"line","x1":155,"y1":24,"x2":168,"y2":122,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":72,"y1":172,"x2":168,"y2":122,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":238,"y1":172,"x2":168,"y2":122,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"line","x1":238,"y1":172,"x2":282,"y2":82,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"line","x1":168,"y1":122,"x2":282,"y2":82,"color":"#D97706","dashed":true},{"type":"point","x":155,"y":24,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"point","x":72,"y":172,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"point","x":238,"y":172,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"point","x":168,"y":122,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":282,"y":82,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"text","x":150,"y":6,"text":"A","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":56,"y":174,"text":"B","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":242,"y":174,"text":"C","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":162,"y":130,"text":"O","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":286,"y":76,"text":"D","color":"#0284C7"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 105, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
