SELECT 'g8', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'ESSAY', '已知 $a = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3} - \\sqrt{2}}$，$b = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3} + \\sqrt{2}}$。\n(1) 分别化简 $a$ 与 $b$；\n(2) 求代数式 $a^2 - ab + b^2$ 的值。', '[]', '{"text":"解：\\n(1) $a = \\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{3} + \\\\sqrt{2}}{(\\\\sqrt{3} - \\\\sqrt{2})(\\\\sqrt{3} + \\\\sqrt{2})} = \\\\sqrt{3} + \\\\sqrt{2}$；\\n$b = \\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{3} - \\\\sqrt{2}}{(\\\\sqrt{3} + \\\\sqrt{2})(\\\\sqrt{3} - \\\\sqrt{2})} = \\\\sqrt{3} - \\\\sqrt{2}$。\\n(2) 由(1)得 $a + b = 2\\\\sqrt{3}$，$ab = (\\\\sqrt{3})^2 - (\\\\sqrt{2})^2 = 1$。\\n所以 $a^2 - ab + b^2 = (a + b)^2 - 3ab = (2\\\\sqrt{3})^2 - 3 \\\\times 1 = 12 - 3 = 9$。"}', '【得分要点】熟练运用平方差进行分母有理化，再利用对称式 $a+b$ 与 $ab$ 整体求值。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["有理化与对称式求值","手写解答","TASK-20261122-002"]', NULL, 'ADMIN', 1, 105, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
