SELECT 'g8', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '如图，一个长为 $5\\text{ m}$ 的梯子斜靠在墙上，梯子底端距墙角 $3\\text{ m}$。若梯子顶端下滑 $1\\text{ m}$，则底端向外滑动（  ）$\\text{m}$', '["$1$","$2$","$0.5$","$1.5$"]', '{"index":0}', '原来高 $\\sqrt{5^2 - 3^2} = 4\\text{ m}$，下滑 $1\\text{ m}$ 后高变为 $3\\text{ m}$，此时底距墙 $\\sqrt{5^2 - 3^2} = 4\\text{ m}$，向外滑动 $4 - 3 = 1\\text{ m}$。', NULL, NULL, 2, '["梯子滑动模型","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"梯子靠墙下滑示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"line","x1":74,"y1":24,"x2":74,"y2":176,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":54,"y1":176,"x2":284,"y2":176,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"rightAngle","vx":74,"vy":176,"ax":74,"ay":24,"bx":284,"by":176,"size":12,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"line","x1":74,"y1":48,"x2":170,"y2":176,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"line","x1":74,"y1":80,"x2":202,"y2":176,"color":"#DC2626","dashed":true},{"type":"point","x":74,"y":48,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":170,"y":176,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":74,"y":80,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":202,"y":176,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":52,"y":42,"text":"A","color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"text","x":46,"y":76,"text":"A\'","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":56,"y":180,"text":"O","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":164,"y":181,"text":"B","color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"text","x":198,"y":181,"text":"B\'","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":124,"y":92,"text":"5m","color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"text","x":108,"y":182,"text":"3m","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":24,"y":58,"text":"↓1m","color":"#DC2626"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 102, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
