SELECT 'g8', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '下列条件中，能判定四边形 $ABCD$ 为平行四边形的是（  ）', '["$AB \\\\parallel CD$ 且 $AB = CD$","$AB \\\\parallel CD$ 且 $AD = BC$","$\\\\angle A = \\\\angle B$ 且 $\\\\angle C = \\\\angle D$","$AB = BC$ 且 $AD = CD$"]', '{"index":0}', '一组对边平行且相等的四边形是平行四边形；一组平行另一组相等可能是等腰梯形。', NULL, NULL, 2, '["平行四边形判定","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"平行四边形 ABCD","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"polygon","points":[[96,42],[264,42],[224,168],[56,168]],"color":"#1E293B","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"line","x1":96,"y1":42,"x2":224,"y2":168,"color":"#64748B","dashed":true},{"type":"line","x1":264,"y1":42,"x2":56,"y2":168,"color":"#64748B","dashed":true},{"type":"point","x":160,"y":105,"label":"O","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":84,"y":24,"text":"A","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":266,"y":24,"text":"D","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":228,"y":170,"text":"C","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":42,"y":170,"text":"B","color":"#1E293B"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 101, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
