SELECT 'g8', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'ESSAY', '已知：在平行四边形 $ABCD$ 中，$E$、$F$ 分别是 $AB$、$CD$ 上的点，且 $AE = CF$。\n求证：四边形 $DEBF$ 是平行四边形，且 $DE = BF$。', '[]', '{"text":"证明：\\n因为四边形 $ABCD$ 是平行四边形，\\n所以 $AB \\\\parallel CD$，且 $AB = CD$。\\n因为 $AE = CF$，所以 $AB - AE = CD - CF$，即 $BE = DF$。\\n又因为 $AB \\\\parallel CD$，即 $BE \\\\parallel DF$。\\n有一组对边平行且相等的四边形是平行四边形，\\n所以四边形 $DEBF$ 是平行四边形。\\n因此 $DE = BF$（平行四边形对边相等）。"}', '【得分要点】正确利用平行四边形对边平行且相等推得 $BE \\parallel DF$ 且 $BE = DF$，再依判定定理得证。', NULL, NULL, 3, '["平行四边形判定证明","手写解答","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"平行四边形 ABCD","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"polygon","points":[[96,42],[264,42],[224,168],[56,168]],"color":"#1E293B","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"line","x1":96,"y1":42,"x2":224,"y2":168,"color":"#64748B","dashed":true},{"type":"line","x1":264,"y1":42,"x2":56,"y2":168,"color":"#64748B","dashed":true},{"type":"point","x":160,"y":105,"label":"O","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":84,"y":24,"text":"A","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":266,"y":24,"text":"D","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":228,"y":170,"text":"C","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":42,"y":170,"text":"B","color":"#1E293B"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 104, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
