SELECT 'g8', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '“十字架模型”：在正方形 $ABCD$ 内部，两条线段 $EF$ 和 $GH$（端点分别在两对对边上）若满足 $EF \\perp GH$，则一定有（  ）', '["$EF = GH$","$EF = 2GH$","$EF$ 平分 $GH$","$GH$ 过正方形中心"]', '{"index":0}', '过两边端点作垂线构造全等直角三角形，可得正方形中垂直必相等，即 $EF = GH$。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["十字架模型","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"正方形 ABCD","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"polygon","points":[[90,32],[230,32],[230,172],[90,172]],"color":"#1E293B","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"line","x1":90,"y1":32,"x2":230,"y2":172,"color":"#64748B","dashed":true},{"type":"line","x1":230,"y1":32,"x2":90,"y2":172,"color":"#64748B","dashed":true},{"type":"rightAngle","vx":90,"vy":172,"ax":90,"ay":32,"bx":230,"by":172,"size":11,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"text","x":74,"y":22,"text":"A","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":234,"y":22,"text":"D","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":234,"y":174,"text":"C","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":74,"y":174,"text":"B","color":"#1E293B"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 102, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
