SELECT 'g9', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'ESSAY', '用适当的方法解下列方程：\n(1) $x^2 - 6x + 5 = 0$；\n(2) $2x^2 - 4x - 1 = 0$。', '[]', '{"text":"解：\\n(1) 因式分解得 $(x - 1)(x - 5) = 0$，\\n解得 $x_1 = 1$，$x_2 = 5$。\\n(2) 由公式法：$a = 2$，$b = -4$，$c = -1$，\\n$\\\\Delta = (-4)^2 - 4 \\\\times 2 \\\\times (-1) = 16 + 8 = 24 > 0$，\\n$x = \\\\frac{4 \\\\pm \\\\sqrt{24}}{4} = \\\\frac{4 \\\\pm 2\\\\sqrt{6}}{4} = 1 \\\\pm \\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{6}}{2}$，\\n即 $x_1 = 1 + \\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{6}}{2}$，$x_2 = 1 - \\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{6}}{2}$。"}', '【得分要点】第(1)题十字相乘得 $1, 5$；第(2)题求根公式分母为 $2a=4$，化简 $\\sqrt{24}=2\\sqrt{6}$ 并约分正确。', NULL, NULL, 3, '["解一元二次方程","手写解答","TASK-20261122-002"]', NULL, 'ADMIN', 1, 104, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
