SELECT 'g9', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'ESSAY', '已知二次函数 $y = x^2 - 2x - 3$。\n(1) 写出它的开口方向、对称轴和顶点坐标；\n(2) 求抛物线与 $x$ 轴的交点 $A$、$B$ 的坐标及与 $y$ 轴的交点 $C$ 的坐标；\n(3) 计算 $\\triangle ABC$ 的面积。', '[]', '{"text":"解：\\n(1) 配方得 $y = (x - 1)^2 - 4$。\\n所以抛物线开口向上，对称轴是直线 $x = 1$，顶点坐标为 $(1, -4)$。\\n(2) 令 $y = 0$，得 $x^2 - 2x - 3 = 0 \\\\Rightarrow (x - 3)(x + 1) = 0$，解得 $x_1 = -1$，$x_2 = 3$，\\n所以 $A(-1, 0)$，$B(3, 0)$。\\n令 $x = 0$，得 $y = -3$，所以 $C(0, -3)$。\\n(3) $AB = 3 - (-1) = 4$，点 $C$ 到 $x$ 轴的距离为 $|-3| = 3$，\\n故 $S_{\\\\triangle ABC} = \\\\frac{1}{2} \\\\times 4 \\\\times 3 = 6$。"}', '【得分要点】准确配方得出顶点 $(1,-4)$，求准三交点坐标，面积求得 $6$。', NULL, NULL, 3, '["抛物线图像与面积","手写解答","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"二次函数抛物线示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":26,"y1":148,"x2":294,"y2":148,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"arrow","x1":160,"y1":194,"x2":160,"y2":18,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":284,"y":154,"text":"x","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":167,"y":16,"text":"y","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":147,"y":153,"text":"O","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"polyline","points":[[78.8,25.4],[83.3,41.8],[87.8,57.2],[92.3,71.7],[96.8,85.2],[101.4,97.8],[105.9,109.5],[110.4,120.3],[114.9,130.1],[119.4,139],[123.9,146.9],[128.4,153.9],[132.9,160],[137.4,165.1],[142,169.3],[146.5,172.6],[151,174.9],[155.5,176.3],[160,176.8],[164.5,176.3],[169,174.9],[173.5,172.6],[178,169.3],[182.6,165.1],[187.1,160],[191.6,153.9],[196.1,146.9],[200.6,139],[205.1,130.1],[209.6,120.3],[214.1,109.5],[218.6,97.8],[223.2,85.2],[227.7,71.7],[232.2,57.2],[236.7,41.8],[241.2,25.4]],"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"line","x1":160,"y1":24,"x2":160,"y2":188,"color":"#DC2626","dashed":true},{"type":"point","x":160,"y":176.8,"label":"顶点","color":"#DC2626"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 104, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
