SELECT 'g9', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '已知抛物线 $y = ax^2 + bx + c$（$a > 0$）经过 $(-1, 0)$ 和 $(3, 0)$ 两点，若点 $P(m, y_1)$ 与点 $Q(4, y_2)$ 均在抛物线上且 $y_1 < y_2$，则 $m$ 的取值范围是（  ）', '["$-2 < m < 4$","$m < 4$","$-1 < m < 3$","$1 < m < 4$"]', '{"index":0}', '由两零点得对称轴为 $x = \\frac{-1+3}{2} = 1$；点 $Q(4, y_2)$ 到对称轴距离为 $|4 - 1| = 3$。因 $a > 0$，距离对称轴越近函数值越小，故 $|m - 1| < 3 \\Rightarrow -2 < m < 4$。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["抛物线对称性比大小","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"二次函数抛物线示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":26,"y1":148,"x2":294,"y2":148,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"arrow","x1":160,"y1":194,"x2":160,"y2":18,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":284,"y":154,"text":"x","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":167,"y":16,"text":"y","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":147,"y":153,"text":"O","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"polyline","points":[[78.8,25.4],[83.3,41.8],[87.8,57.2],[92.3,71.7],[96.8,85.2],[101.4,97.8],[105.9,109.5],[110.4,120.3],[114.9,130.1],[119.4,139],[123.9,146.9],[128.4,153.9],[132.9,160],[137.4,165.1],[142,169.3],[146.5,172.6],[151,174.9],[155.5,176.3],[160,176.8],[164.5,176.3],[169,174.9],[173.5,172.6],[178,169.3],[182.6,165.1],[187.1,160],[191.6,153.9],[196.1,146.9],[200.6,139],[205.1,130.1],[209.6,120.3],[214.1,109.5],[218.6,97.8],[223.2,85.2],[227.7,71.7],[232.2,57.2],[236.7,41.8],[241.2,25.4]],"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"line","x1":160,"y1":24,"x2":160,"y2":188,"color":"#DC2626","dashed":true},{"type":"point","x":160,"y":176.8,"label":"顶点","color":"#DC2626"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 101, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
