SELECT 'g9', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '二次函数 $y = ax^2 + bx + c$ 的图象如图所示：经过 $(-1, 0)$，对称轴为 $x = 1$，开口向下（$a<0$），则下列结论：① $b^2 - 4ac > 0$；② $2a + b = 0$；③ $3a + c = 0$；④ 当 $x = 3$ 时 $y = 0$。其中正确的有（  ）个', '["$4$","$3$","$2$","$1$"]', '{"index":0}', '① 两交点故 $\\Delta > 0$；② 对称轴 $-\\frac{b}{2a}=1 \\Rightarrow 2a+b=0$；③ $x=-1$ 时 $a-b+c=0$，代入 $b=-2a$ 得 $3a+c=0$；④ 由对称性另一交点为 $x = 3$。全部 $4$ 个均正确！', NULL, NULL, 4, '["抛物线多结论判断","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"二次函数图象示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":26,"y1":148,"x2":292,"y2":148,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"arrow","x1":128,"y1":194,"x2":128,"y2":18,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":282,"y":154,"text":"x","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":135,"y":16,"text":"y","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":115,"y":153,"text":"O","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"line","x1":160,"y1":26,"x2":160,"y2":190,"color":"#DC2626","dashed":true},{"type":"polyline","points":[[80,187.6],[84,176.9],[88,166.7],[92,157.1],[96,148],[100,139.5],[104,131.5],[108,124.1],[112,117.2],[116,110.9],[120,105.1],[124,99.9],[128,95.2],[132,91.1],[136,87.5],[140,84.5],[144,82],[148,80.1],[152,78.7],[156,77.9],[160,77.6],[164,77.9],[168,78.7],[172,80.1],[176,82],[180,84.5],[184,87.5],[188,91.1],[192,95.2],[196,99.9],[200,105.1],[204,110.9],[208,117.2],[212,124.1],[216,131.5],[220,139.5],[224,148],[228,157.1],[232,166.7],[236,176.9],[240,187.6]],"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":96,"y":148,"label":"(-1,0)","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":224,"y":148,"label":"(3,0)","color":"#059669"},{"type":"text","x":164,"y":26,"text":"x = 1","color":"#DC2626"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 102, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
