SELECT 'g9', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'ESSAY', '已知抛物线 $y = -x^2 + bx + c$ 经过点 $A(-1, 0)$ 和 $B(3, 0)$，与 $y$ 轴交于点 $C$。\n(1) 求该抛物线的解析式及点 $C$ 的坐标；\n(2) 设点 $P$ 是第一象限内抛物线上的一个动点（不与 $B$、$C$ 重合），求 $\\triangle PBC$ 面积的最大值及此时点 $P$ 的坐标。', '[]', '{"text":"解：\\n(1) 设交点式 $y = -(x + 1)(x - 3) = -x^2 + 2x + 3$。\\n令 $x = 0$，得 $y = 3$，所以点 $C$ 的坐标为 $(0, 3)$。\\n(2) 直线 $BC$ 经过 $B(3, 0)$ 与 $C(0, 3)$，可求得直线 $BC$ 的解析式为 $y = -x + 3$。\\n设点 $P(t, -t^2 + 2t + 3)$（$0 < t < 3$），过 $P$ 作 $y$ 轴的平行线交 $BC$ 于点 $Q(t, -t + 3)$。\\n则铅垂线段 $PQ = (-t^2 + 2t + 3) - (-t + 3) = -t^2 + 3t$。\\n$S_{\\\\triangle PBC} = \\\\frac{1}{2} \\\\cdot OB \\\\cdot PQ = \\\\frac{1}{2} \\\\times 3 \\\\times (-t^2 + 3t) = -\\\\frac{3}{2}(t - \\\\frac{3}{2})^2 + \\\\frac{27}{8}$。\\n当 $t = \\\\frac{3}{2}$ 时，$S_{\\\\triangle PBC}$ 取得最大值 $\\\\frac{27}{8}$，\\n此时 $y_P = -(\\\\frac{3}{2})^2 + 2\\\\times \\\\frac{3}{2} + 3 = \\\\frac{15}{4}$，即 $P(\\\\frac{3}{2}, \\\\frac{15}{4})$。"}', '【得分要点】(1) 快速用交点式求解析式；(2) 求直线 $BC$ 后用铅垂法表示 $PQ$，配方求得面积最大值 $\\frac{27}{8}$ 及点 $P$ 坐标。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["二次函数铅垂法面积最值","压轴综合","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"二次函数抛物线示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":26,"y1":148,"x2":294,"y2":148,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"arrow","x1":160,"y1":194,"x2":160,"y2":18,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":284,"y":154,"text":"x","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":167,"y":16,"text":"y","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":147,"y":153,"text":"O","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"polyline","points":[[78.8,25.4],[83.3,41.8],[87.8,57.2],[92.3,71.7],[96.8,85.2],[101.4,97.8],[105.9,109.5],[110.4,120.3],[114.9,130.1],[119.4,139],[123.9,146.9],[128.4,153.9],[132.9,160],[137.4,165.1],[142,169.3],[146.5,172.6],[151,174.9],[155.5,176.3],[160,176.8],[164.5,176.3],[169,174.9],[173.5,172.6],[178,169.3],[182.6,165.1],[187.1,160],[191.6,153.9],[196.1,146.9],[200.6,139],[205.1,130.1],[209.6,120.3],[214.1,109.5],[218.6,97.8],[223.2,85.2],[227.7,71.7],[232.2,57.2],[236.7,41.8],[241.2,25.4]],"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"line","x1":160,"y1":24,"x2":160,"y2":188,"color":"#DC2626","dashed":true},{"type":"point","x":160,"y":176.8,"label":"顶点","color":"#DC2626"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 105, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
