SELECT 'g9', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'ESSAY', '如图，点 $P$ 是正方形 $ABCD$ 内部一点，连接 $PA$、$PB$、$PC$，已知 $PA = 2$，$PB = 4$，$PC = 6$，试通过旋转法求 $\\angle APB$ 的度数。', '[]', '{"text":"解：\\n将 $\\\\triangle ABP$ 绕点 $B$ 顺时针旋转 $90^\\\\circ$ 得到 $\\\\triangle CBP\'$，连接 $PP\'$。\\n由旋转性质得：$\\\\triangle ABP \\\\cong \\\\triangle CBP\'$，\\n所以 $BP\' = BP = 4$，$CP\' = AP = 2$，$\\\\angle PBP\' = 90^\\\\circ$，$\\\\angle APB = \\\\angle CP\'B$。\\n在 $\\\\text{Rt}\\\\triangle PBP\'$ 中，$\\\\angle BP\'P = 45^\\\\circ$，且 $PP\' = \\\\sqrt{4^2 + 4^2} = 4\\\\sqrt{2}$。\\n在 $\\\\triangle PP\'C$ 中：\\n$PP\'^2 + CP\'^2 = (4\\\\sqrt{2})^2 + 2^2 = 32 + 4 = 36 = 6^2 = PC^2$。\\n由勾股定理逆定理知 $\\\\triangle PP\'C$ 是直角三角形，且 $\\\\angle PP\'C = 90^\\\\circ$。\\n因此 $\\\\angle CP\'B = \\\\angle BP\'P + \\\\angle PP\'C = 45^\\\\circ + 90^\\\\circ = 135^\\\\circ$，\\n故 $\\\\angle APB = 135^\\\\circ$。"}', '【得分要点】正确旋转 $90^\\circ$ 构造等腰直角三角形，先求 $PP\'=4\\sqrt{2}$，再用勾股定理逆定理证 $\\angle PP\'C=90^\\circ$ 得 $135^\\circ$。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["正方形旋转勾股倒角","手写解答","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"正方形内点旋转 (PA=2, PB=4, PC=6)","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"polygon","points":[[88,30],[88,170],[228,170],[228,30]],"color":"#1E293B","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"line","x1":88,"y1":30,"x2":140,"y2":104,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"line","x1":88,"y1":170,"x2":140,"y2":104,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"line","x1":228,"y1":170,"x2":140,"y2":104,"color":"#059669"},{"type":"point","x":140,"y":104,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":72,"y":18,"text":"A","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":72,"y":174,"text":"B","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":232,"y":174,"text":"C","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":232,"y":18,"text":"D","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":146,"y":94,"text":"P","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":102,"y":58,"text":"2","color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"text","x":100,"y":134,"text":"4","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":182,"y":144,"text":"6","color":"#059669"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 105, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
