SELECT 'g9', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '同圆或等圆中，若圆周角 $\\angle ACB = 35^\\circ$，则它所对的圆心角 $\\angle AOB$ 的度数为（  ）', '["$70^\\\\circ$","$35^\\\\circ$","$17.5^\\\\circ$","$105^\\\\circ$"]', '{"index":0}', '同弧所对的圆心角等于圆周角的 $2$ 倍，即 $2 \\times 35^\\circ = 70^\\circ$。', NULL, NULL, 1, '["圆周角定理","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"圆心角与圆周角关系","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"circle","cx":160,"cy":108,"r":72,"color":"#1E293B","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"line","x1":160,"y1":108,"x2":102,"y2":150,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"line","x1":160,"y1":108,"x2":218,"y2":150,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"line","x1":146,"y1":37,"x2":102,"y2":150,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"line","x1":146,"y1":37,"x2":218,"y2":150,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":160,"y":108,"label":"O","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":146,"y":37,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"text","x":86,"y":154,"text":"A","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":222,"y":154,"text":"B","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":142,"y":18,"text":"C","color":"#0284C7"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 102, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
