SELECT 'g9', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'ESSAY', '如图，$AB$ 是 $\\odot O$ 的直径，点 $C$ 在 $\\odot O$ 上，过点 $C$ 作 $\\odot O$ 的切线，交 $AB$ 的延长线于点 $D$。若 $\\angle CAB = 25^\\circ$，求 $\\angle D$ 的度数。', '[]', '{"text":"解：\\n连接 $OC$。\\n因为 $CD$ 是 $\\\\odot O$ 的切线，所以 $OC \\\\perp CD$，即 $\\\\angle OCD = 90^\\\\circ$。\\n因为 $OA = OC$，$\\\\angle CAB = 25^\\\\circ$，\\n所以 $\\\\angle OCA = \\\\angle CAB = 25^\\\\circ$，\\n由三角形外角定理得 $\\\\angle COD = \\\\angle CAB + \\\\angle OCA = 25^\\\\circ + 25^\\\\circ = 50^\\\\circ$。\\n在 $\\\\text{Rt}\\\\triangle OCD$ 中，$\\\\angle D = 90^\\\\circ - \\\\angle COD = 90^\\\\circ - 50^\\\\circ = 40^\\\\circ$。"}', '【得分要点】连半径 $OC$ 构造垂直 $\\angle OCD=90^\\circ$，由半径相等倒角求得 $\\angle COD=50^\\circ$，再得 $\\angle D=40^\\circ$。', NULL, NULL, 3, '["切线性质辅助线","手写解答","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"圆的切线与圆心角模型","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"circle","cx":124,"cy":112,"r":66,"color":"#1E293B","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"line","x1":58,"y1":112,"x2":286,"y2":112,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":124,"y1":112,"x2":166,"y2":61,"color":"#64748B","dashed":true},{"type":"line","x1":58,"y1":112,"x2":166,"y2":61,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"line","x1":166,"y1":61,"x2":260,"y2":112,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"rightAngle","vx":166,"vy":61,"ax":124,"ay":112,"bx":260,"by":112,"size":10,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":124,"y":112,"label":"O","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"point","x":58,"y":112,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"point","x":190,"y":112,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"point","x":166,"y":61,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":260,"y":112,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":42,"y":108,"text":"A","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":186,"y":118,"text":"B","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":164,"y":42,"text":"C","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":262,"y":118,"text":"D","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":84,"y":96,"text":"25°","color":"#0284C7"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 104, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
