SELECT 'g9', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '已知 $\\odot O$ 的半径为 $10$，两条平行弦 $AB = 12$，$CD = 16$，则这两条平行弦之间的距离为（  ）', '["$2$ 或 $14$","一定为 $14$","一定为 $2$","$4$ 或 $28$"]', '{"index":0}', '分别求弦心距 $d_1 = \\sqrt{10^2 - 6^2} = 8$，$d_2 = \\sqrt{10^2 - 8^2} = 6$。两弦在圆心同侧时距 $8 - 6 = 2$；在异侧时距 $8 + 6 = 14$。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["平行弦距离双解","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"垂径定理示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"circle","cx":160,"cy":106,"r":72,"color":"#1E293B","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"line","x1":100,"y1":146,"x2":220,"y2":146,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"line","x1":160,"y1":106,"x2":160,"y2":146,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"line","x1":160,"y1":106,"x2":220,"y2":146,"color":"#64748B","dashed":true},{"type":"rightAngle","vx":160,"vy":146,"ax":160,"ay":106,"bx":220,"by":146,"size":10,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":160,"y":106,"label":"O","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":84,"y":148,"text":"A","color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"text","x":224,"y":148,"text":"B","color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"text","x":154,"y":152,"text":"C","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":192,"y":116,"text":"r","color":"#64748B"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 101, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
