SELECT 'g9', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '某转盘被等分成 $6$ 个扇形，分别标有数字 $1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6$，转动转盘两次，两次指针指向的数字之和为 $7$ 的概率是（  ）', '["$\\\\frac{1}{6}$","$\\\\frac{1}{12}$","$\\\\frac{5}{36}$","$\\\\frac{7}{36}$"]', '{"index":0}', '总共 $36$ 种情况，和为 $7$ 的有 $(1,6),(2,5),(3,4),(4,3),(5,2),(6,1)$ 共 $6$ 种，故概率为 $\\frac{6}{36} = \\frac{1}{6}$。', NULL, NULL, 3, '["双转盘和事件概率","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"六等分数字转盘（1~6）","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"circle","cx":160,"cy":108,"r":72,"color":"#1E293B","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"line","x1":160,"y1":108,"x2":160,"y2":36,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":179,"y":61.162831425915826,"text":"1","color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"line","x1":160,"y1":108,"x2":222.35382907247958,"y2":72,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":202,"y":101,"text":"2","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"line","x1":160,"y1":108,"x2":222.35382907247958,"y2":144,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":179,"y":140.83716857408416,"text":"3","color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"line","x1":160,"y1":108,"x2":160,"y2":180,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":133,"y":140.8371685740842,"text":"4","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"line","x1":160,"y1":108,"x2":97.64617092752042,"y2":144,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":110,"y":101,"text":"5","color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"line","x1":160,"y1":108,"x2":97.64617092752042,"y2":72,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":132.99999999999997,"y":61.16283142591584,"text":"6","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"arrow","x1":160,"y1":108,"x2":198,"y2":86,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":160,"y":108,"color":"#1E293B"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 102, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
