SELECT 'g9', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'ESSAY', '如图，一次函数 $y = kx + b$ 的图象与反比例函数 $y = \\frac{m}{x}$ 的图象相交于 $A(-2, 1)$、$B(1, n)$ 两点。\n(1) 求反比例函数和一次函数的解析式；\n(2) 求 $\\triangle AOB$ 的面积；\n(3) 直接写出当 $x$ 在什么范围时，一次函数值小于反比例函数值（即 $kx + b < \\frac{m}{x}$）？', '[]', '{"text":"解：\\n(1) 把 $A(-2, 1)$ 代入 $y = \\\\frac{m}{x}$，得 $m = -2$，故反比例函数解析式为 $y = -\\\\frac{2}{x}$。\\n把 $B(1, n)$ 代入 $y = -\\\\frac{2}{x}$，得 $n = -2$，即 $B(1, -2)$。\\n将 $A(-2, 1)$、$B(1, -2)$ 代入 $y = kx + b$，得 $\\\\begin{cases} -2k + b = 1 \\\\\\\\ k + b = -2 \\\\end{cases}$，解得 $k = -1, b = -1$。\\n所以一次函数解析式为 $y = -x - 1$。\\n(2) 直线 $y = -x - 1$ 与 $y$ 轴交于点 $C(0, -1)$，\\n所以 $S_{\\\\triangle AOB} = S_{\\\\triangle AOC} + S_{\\\\triangle BOC} = \\\\frac{1}{2} \\\\times 1 \\\\times |-2| + \\\\frac{1}{2} \\\\times 1 \\\\times 1 = 1 + 0.5 = \\\\frac{3}{2}$。\\n(3) 结合图象，直线在双曲线下方时自变量范围为：$-2 < x < 0$ 或 $x > 1$。"}', '【得分要点】(1) 分别求准 $y=-\\frac{2}{x}$ 与 $y=-x-1$；(2) 用截距拆成左右两个三角形求面积 $\\frac{3}{2}$；(3) 写出两段区间且不能遗漏 $x=0$ 断点。', NULL, NULL, 3, '["一次与反比例综合","手写解答","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"一次函数与反比例函数交点图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":26,"y1":108,"x2":294,"y2":108,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"arrow","x1":160,"y1":196,"x2":160,"y2":16,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":284,"y":114,"text":"x","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":167,"y":14,"text":"y","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":147,"y":113,"text":"O","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"polyline","points":[[44.4,91.5],[47.7,91],[51.1,90.5],[54.4,90],[57.8,89.4],[61.1,88.7],[64.4,88.1],[67.8,87.4],[71.1,86.6],[74.5,85.7],[77.8,84.8],[81.1,83.9],[84.5,82.8],[87.8,81.6],[91.2,80.3],[94.5,78.9],[97.8,77.4],[101.2,75.6],[104.5,73.7],[107.8,71.5],[111.2,69],[114.5,66.1],[117.9,62.8],[121.2,58.9],[124.5,54.3],[127.9,48.7],[131.2,41.8],[134.6,33.2],[137.9,21.8]],"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"polyline","points":[[182.1,194.2],[185.4,182.8],[188.8,174.2],[192.1,167.3],[195.5,161.7],[198.8,157.1],[202.1,153.2],[205.5,149.9],[208.8,147],[212.2,144.5],[215.5,142.3],[218.8,140.4],[222.2,138.6],[225.5,137.1],[228.9,135.7],[232.2,134.4],[235.5,133.2],[238.9,132.1],[242.2,131.2],[245.5,130.3],[248.9,129.4],[252.2,128.6],[255.6,127.9],[258.9,127.3],[262.2,126.6],[265.6,126],[268.9,125.5],[272.3,125],[275.6,124.5]],"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"line","x1":51.19999999999999,"y1":46.39999999999999,"x2":234.8,"y2":197.60000000000002,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":92,"y":80,"label":"A(-2,1)","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":194,"y":164,"label":"B(1,n)","color":"#DC2626"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 104, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
