SELECT 'g9', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '如图，点 $A$、$B$ 在反比例函数 $y = \\frac{6}{x}$（$x > 0$）的图象上，点 $C$、$D$ 在 $x$ 轴上且 $AC \\perp x$ 轴于 $C$、$BD \\perp x$ 轴于 $D$，若 $OC = CD$，则梯形 $ABDC$ 的面积是（  ）', '["$\\\\frac{9}{2}$","$6$","$3$","$9$"]', '{"index":0}', '设 $OC = a$，则 $OD = 2a$，故 $A(a, \\frac{6}{a})$、$B(2a, \\frac{3}{a})$。梯形面积 $= \\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{6}{a} + \\frac{3}{a}) \\cdot a = \\frac{9}{2}$。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["双曲线梯形面积定值","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"反比例函数与梯形 ABDC","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":26,"y1":176,"x2":294,"y2":176,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"arrow","x1":54,"y1":196,"x2":54,"y2":18,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":284,"y":182,"text":"x","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":61,"y":16,"text":"y","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":41,"y":181,"text":"O","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"polygon","points":[[123,88],[192,132],[192,176],[123,176]],"color":"#DC2626","fillColor":"#FBBF24"},{"type":"polyline","points":[[95.4,29.3],[100.4,45.1],[105.4,57.8],[110.4,68.2],[115.3,77],[120.3,84.4],[125.3,90.8],[130.3,96.4],[135.3,101.3],[140.3,105.6],[145.2,109.4],[150.2,112.9],[155.2,116],[160.2,118.8],[165.2,121.4],[170.1,123.7],[175.1,125.9],[180.1,127.9],[185.1,129.7],[190.1,131.4],[195.1,133],[200,134.4],[205,135.8],[210,137.1],[215,138.3],[220,139.4],[225,140.5],[230,141.5],[234.9,142.4],[239.9,143.3],[244.9,144.2],[249.9,145],[254.9,145.8],[259.9,146.5],[264.8,147.2],[269.8,147.9],[274.8,148.5]],"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":123,"y":88,"label":"A","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":192,"y":132,"label":"B","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":123,"y":176,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"point","x":192,"y":176,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":119,"y":182,"text":"C","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":188,"y":182,"text":"D","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":226,"y":46,"text":"y = 6/x","color":"#0284C7"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 101, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
