SELECT 'g9', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '若反比例函数 $y = \\frac{k}{x}$（$k > 0$）的图象与正方形或矩形交点中，矩形 $OABC$ 的两边在坐标轴上，顶点 $B(4, 3)$，双曲线 $y = \\frac{k}{x}$ 分别交边 $AB$ 于 $D$、交 $BC$ 于 $E$，若 $D$ 是 $AB$ 中点，则 $\\triangle ODE$ 的面积为（  ）', '["$\\\\frac{9}{2}$","$6$","$3$","$4$"]', '{"index":0}', '$AB$ 中点 $D(4, 1.5)$ 代入得 $k = 4 \\times 1.5 = 6$。于是 $E(2, 3)$，$S_{\\text{矩形}} = 12$，减去三个直角三角形：$S_{\\triangle OAD} = 3$，$S_{\\triangle OCE} = 3$，$S_{\\triangle BDE} = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 2 \\times 1.5 = 1.5$，故 $S_{\\triangle ODE} = 12 - 3 - 3 - 1.5 = 4.5 = \\frac{9}{2}$。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["矩形截双曲线面积","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"反比例函数 y = k/x 图象示意","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":26,"y1":108,"x2":294,"y2":108,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"arrow","x1":160,"y1":194,"x2":160,"y2":18,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":284,"y":114,"text":"x","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":167,"y":16,"text":"y","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":147,"y":113,"text":"O","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"polyline","points":[[181,12],[184.7,26.2],[188.3,36.8],[192,44.9],[195.6,51.4],[199.3,56.6],[202.9,61],[206.6,64.7],[210.2,67.8],[213.9,70.6],[217.5,72.9],[221.2,75],[224.8,76.9],[228.5,78.5],[232.1,80],[235.8,81.4],[239.4,82.6],[243.1,83.7],[246.7,84.7],[250.4,85.7],[254,86.6],[257.7,87.4],[261.3,88.1],[265,88.8],[268.6,89.4],[272.3,90],[275.9,90.6],[279.6,91.1],[283.2,91.6]],"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"polyline","points":[[36.8,124.4],[40.4,124.9],[44.1,125.4],[47.7,126],[51.4,126.6],[55.1,127.2],[58.7,127.9],[62.4,128.6],[66,129.4],[69.6,130.3],[73.3,131.3],[77,132.3],[80.6,133.4],[84.2,134.6],[87.9,136],[91.6,137.5],[95.2,139.1],[98.9,141],[102.5,143.1],[106.2,145.4],[109.8,148.2],[113.5,151.3],[117.1,155],[120.8,159.4],[124.4,164.6],[128.1,171.1],[131.7,179.2],[135.4,189.8],[139,204]],"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"polygon","points":[[160,108],[216,108],[216,72],[160,72]],"color":"#DC2626","fillColor":"#FBBF24"},{"type":"point","x":216,"y":72,"label":"P(x