SELECT 'g9', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'ESSAY', '如图，在平面直角坐标系中，正比例函数 $y = \\frac{1}{2}x$ 与反比例函数 $y = \\frac{k}{x}$（$x > 0$）的图象交于点 $A(4, a)$。\n(1) 求 $a$ 与 $k$ 的值；\n(2) 在反比例函数第一象限图象上取点 $B(2, b)$，过 $A$、$B$ 作平行于坐标轴的辅助线求出 $\\triangle OAB$ 的面积。', '[]', '{"text":"解：\\n(1) 将 $A(4, a)$ 代入 $y = \\\\frac{1}{2}x$，得 $a = 2$，即 $A(4, 2)$。\\n将 $A(4, 2)$ 代入 $y = \\\\frac{k}{x}$，得 $k = 4 \\\\times 2 = 8$，反比例函数为 $y = \\\\frac{8}{x}$。\\n(2) 把 $x = 2$ 代入 $y = \\\\frac{8}{x}$，得 $b = 4$，即 $B(2, 4)$。\\n方法一（梯形加减 / 矩形补形）：在第一象限利用 $O(0,0), B(2,4), A(4,2)$，作 $BE \\\\perp x$ 轴于 $E(2,0)$，$AF \\\\perp x$ 轴于 $F(4,0)$。\\n因为 $S_{\\\\triangle OBE} = S_{\\\\triangle OAF} = \\\\frac{1}{2}k = 4$，\\n故 $S_{\\\\triangle OAB} = S_{\\\\text{梯形 } BEFA} = \\\\frac{1}{2}(4 + 2) \\\\times (4 - 2) = 6$。"}', '【得分要点】求得 $a=2, k=8$ 及 $B(2,4)$，并运用双曲线经典等面积转换 $S_{\\triangle OAB} = S_{\\text{梯形 } BEFA} = 6$ 求解。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["双曲线等面积转化梯形","手写解答","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"正比例函数与反比例函数综合","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":24,"y1":176,"x2":294,"y2":176,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"arrow","x1":52,"y1":196,"x2":52,"y2":16,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":284,"y":182,"text":"x","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":59,"y":14,"text":"y","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":39,"y":181,"text":"O","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"polygon","points":[[52,176],[220,120],[136,64]],"color":"#059669","fillColor":"#34D399"},{"type":"line","x1":52,"y1":176,"x2":270.4,"y2":103.2,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"polyline","points":[[115,26.7],[120.1,37.9],[125.2,47.5],[130.4,55.9],[135.5,63.3],[140.6,69.8],[145.7,75.6],[150.8,80.8],[156,85.5],[161.1,89.7],[166.2,93.6],[171.3,97.1],[176.4,100.4],[181.5,103.4],[186.7,106.1],[191.8,108.7],[196.9,111.1],[202,113.3],[207.1,115.4],[212.3,117.3],[217.4,119.1],[222.5,120.8],[227.6,122.4],[232.7,123.9],[237.9,125.4],[243,126.7],[248.1,128],[253.2,129.2],[258.3,130.4],[263.4,131.5],[268.6,132.6],[273.7,133.6],[278.8,134.5]],"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":220,"y":120,"label":"A(4,a)","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":136,"y":64,"label":"B(2,b)","color":"#059669"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 105, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
