SELECT 'g9', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '在 $\\triangle ABC$ 中，点 $D$、$E$ 分别在边 $AB$、$AC$ 上，且 $DE \\parallel BC$。若 $AD = 2$，$DB = 4$，$DE = 3$，则 $BC$ 的长是（  ）', '["$9$","$6$","$12$","$7.5$"]', '{"index":0}', '由 A 字型相似 $\\triangle ADE \\sim \\triangle ABC$，得 $\\frac{AD}{AB} = \\frac{DE}{BC}$，即 $\\frac{2}{2+4} = \\frac{3}{BC}$，解得 $BC = 9$。', NULL, NULL, 2, '["A字型相似","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"“A字型”相似模型 (DE ∥ BC)","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"polygon","points":[[158,26],[56,174],[264,174]],"color":"#1E293B","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"line","x1":112,"y1":92,"x2":206,"y2":92,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":112,"y":92,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":206,"y":92,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":152,"y":8,"text":"A","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":40,"y":176,"text":"B","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":268,"y":176,"text":"C","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":94,"y":84,"text":"D","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":212,"y":84,"text":"E","color":"#DC2626"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 101, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
