SELECT 'g9', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '在 $\\triangle ABC$ 中，点 $D$ 在 $AB$ 上，点 $E$ 在 $AC$ 上，下列条件不能判定 $\\triangle ADE$ 与 $\\triangle ABC$ 相似的是（  ）', '["$\\\\frac{AD}{AB} = \\\\frac{DE}{BC}$","$\\\\angle ADE = \\\\angle B$","$\\\\angle AED = \\\\angle C$","$\\\\frac{AD}{AC} = \\\\frac{AE}{AB}$"]', '{"index":0}', '两边对应成比例必须保证夹角相等才能相似；A 项没有夹角信息（两边与对边之比无效），D 项为反 A 字型且含公共角 $\\angle A$ 满足 SAS 相似。', NULL, NULL, 3, '["反A型相似判定","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"“A字型”相似模型 (DE ∥ BC)","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"polygon","points":[[158,26],[56,174],[264,174]],"color":"#1E293B","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"line","x1":112,"y1":92,"x2":206,"y2":92,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":112,"y":92,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":206,"y":92,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":152,"y":8,"text":"A","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":40,"y":176,"text":"B","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":268,"y":176,"text":"C","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":94,"y":84,"text":"D","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":212,"y":84,"text":"E","color":"#DC2626"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 101, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
