SELECT 'g9', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '“一线三等角”相似：在 $\\triangle ABC$ 中，$AB = AC = 6$，$BC = 8$，点 $D$ 在 $BC$ 边上，$BD = 2$，若在 $AC$ 边上取点 $E$ 使 $\\angle ADE = \\angle B$，则 $CE$ 的长是（  ）', '["$2$","$4$","$3$","$\\\\frac{8}{3}$"]', '{"index":0}', '由外角等于内对角及 $AB=AC$ 得 $\\angle B = \\angle C$、$\\angle BAD = \\angle CDE$，故 $\\triangle ABD \\sim \\triangle DCE$。于是 $\\frac{AB}{DC} = \\frac{BD}{CE}$，其中 $DC = 8 - 2 = 6$，代入 $\\frac{6}{6} = \\frac{2}{CE} \\Rightarrow CE = 2$。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["等腰一线三等角相似","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"“A字型”相似模型 (DE ∥ BC)","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"polygon","points":[[158,26],[56,174],[264,174]],"color":"#1E293B","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"line","x1":112,"y1":92,"x2":206,"y2":92,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":112,"y":92,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":206,"y":92,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":152,"y":8,"text":"A","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":40,"y":176,"text":"B","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":268,"y":176,"text":"C","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":94,"y":84,"text":"D","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":212,"y":84,"text":"E","color":"#DC2626"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 102, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
