SELECT 'g9', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '在 $\\triangle ABC$ 中，$\\angle B = 45^\\circ$，$\\angle C = 60^\\circ$，$AB = 4\\sqrt{2}$，则 $AC$ 的长为（  ）', '["$\\\\frac{8\\\\sqrt{3}}{3}$","$4$","$4\\\\sqrt{3}$","$2\\\\sqrt{6}$"]', '{"index":0}', '过 $A$ 作 $AD \\perp BC$ 于 $D$。在 $\\text{Rt}\\triangle ABD$ 中 $AD = AB\\cdot\\mathrm{sin}\\,45^\\circ = 4$；在 $\\text{Rt}\\triangle ADC$ 中 $AC = \\frac{AD}{\\mathrm{sin}\\,60^\\circ} = \\frac{4}{\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}} = \\frac{8\\sqrt{3}}{3}$。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["作高解非直角三角形","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"直角三角形 Rt△ABC","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"polygon","points":[[76,168],[76,44],[254,168]],"color":"#1E293B","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"rightAngle","vx":76,"vy":168,"ax":76,"ay":44,"bx":254,"by":168,"size":12,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":68,"y":24,"text":"A","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":258,"y":166,"text":"B","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":58,"y":172,"text":"C","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"arc","cx":76,"cy":44,"r":24,"startAngle":34,"sweepAngle":56,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"text","x":90,"y":74,"text":"∠A","color":"#0284C7"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 101, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
