SELECT 'g9', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '一个几何体由若干个棱长为 $1$ 的小正方体组成，主视图是两列均为 $2$ 层的 $2\\times 2$ 正方形，俯视图也是填满的 $2\\times 2$ 正方形，搭成这样的几何体最多和最少需要的小正方体个数相差（  ）', '["$2$","$4$","$3$","$5$"]', '{"index":0}', '俯视图 $2\\times 2$ 共 $4$ 格每格至少放 $1$ 个；主视图两列均高 $2$ 只需左右两列各自至少有 $1$ 格高为 $2$，故最少需 $2+2+1+1 = 6$ 个，最多 $4$ 格全高 $2$ 需 $8$ 个，相差 $8 - 6 = 2$ 个。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["三视图最大最小差","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"正方体/长方体示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"polygon","points":[[82,72],[198,72],[198,174],[82,174]],"color":"#1E293B","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"line","x1":82,"y1":72,"x2":130,"y2":36,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":198,"y1":72,"x2":246,"y2":36,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":130,"y1":36,"x2":246,"y2":36,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":246,"y1":36,"x2":246,"y2":138,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":198,"y1":174,"x2":246,"y2":138,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":130,"y1":36,"x2":130,"y2":138,"color":"#64748B","dashed":true},{"type":"line","x1":82,"y1":174,"x2":130,"y2":138,"color":"#64748B","dashed":true},{"type":"line","x1":130,"y1":138,"x2":246,"y2":138,"color":"#64748B","dashed":true}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 101, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
