SELECT 'h1', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'ESSAY', '解关于 $x$ 的不等式：$x^2 - (a + 1)x + a < 0$（其中 $a \\in R$）。', '[]', '{"text":"解：\\n原不等式可因式分解为 $(x - 1)(x - a) < 0$。\\n对应方程的两根分别为 $x_1 = 1$，$x_2 = a$，需按 $a$ 与 $1$ 的大小关系分类讨论：\\n① 当 $a > 1$ 时，解集为 $\\\\{x \\\\mid 1 < x < a\\\\}$；\\n② 当 $a = 1$ 时，原不等式化为 $(x - 1)^2 < 0$，无解，解集为 $\\\\emptyset$；\\n③ 当 $a < 1$ 时，解集为 $\\\\{x \\\\mid a < x < 1\\\\}$。"}', '【得分要点】准确因式分解，不漏掉 $a=1$（空集）、$a>1$、$a<1$ 三种情形并写成集合形式。', NULL, NULL, 3, '["含参一元二次不等式","手写解答","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"二次函数与一元二次不等式解集","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":26,"y1":136,"x2":294,"y2":136,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"arrow","x1":160,"y1":194,"x2":160,"y2":18,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":284,"y":142,"text":"x","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":167,"y":16,"text":"y","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":147,"y":141,"text":"O","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"polyline","points":[[78.4,58.2],[83.2,70.1],[88,81.2],[92.8,91.6],[97.6,101.3],[102.4,110.3],[107.2,118.5],[112,126],[116.8,132.9],[121.6,139],[126.4,144.3],[131.2,149],[136,153],[140.8,156.2],[145.6,158.7],[150.4,160.5],[155.2,161.6],[160,161.9],[164.8,161.6],[169.6,160.5],[174.4,158.7],[179.2,156.2],[184,153],[188.8,149],[193.6,144.3],[198.4,139],[203.2,132.9],[208,126],[212.8,118.5],[217.6,110.3],[222.4,101.3],[227.2,91.6],[232,81.2],[236.8,70.1],[241.6,58.2]],"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"line","x1":119.2,"y1":136,"x2":200.8,"y2":136,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":119.2,"y":136,"label":"x₁","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":200.8,"y":136,"label":"x₂","color":"#DC2626"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 104, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
