SELECT 'h1', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'ESSAY', '已知函数 $f(x) = \\frac{x}{x^2 + 1}$。\n(1) 判断函数 $f(x)$ 的奇偶性并证明；\n(2) 用单调性定义证明函数 $f(x)$ 在区间 $[1, +\\infty)$ 上单调递减；\n(3) 求函数 $f(x)$ 在区间 $[1, 3]$ 上的最大值与最小值。', '[]', '{"text":"解：\\n(1) 函数定义域为 $R$（关于原点对称）。\\n因为 $f(-x) = \\\\frac{-x}{(-x)^2 + 1} = -\\\\frac{x}{x^2 + 1} = -f(x)$，所以 $f(x)$ 是奇函数。\\n(2) 证明：任取 $x_1, x_2 \\\\in [1, +\\\\infty)$，且 $x_1 < x_2$。\\n$f(x_1) - f(x_2) = \\\\frac{x_1}{x_1^2 + 1} - \\\\frac{x_2}{x_2^2 + 1} = \\\\frac{x_1(x_2^2 + 1) - x_2(x_1^2 + 1)}{(x_1^2 + 1)(x_2^2 + 1)} = \\\\frac{(x_2 - x_1)(x_1 x_2 - 1)}{(x_1^2 + 1)(x_2^2 + 1)}$。\\n因为 $1 \\\\le x_1 < x_2$，所以 $x_2 - x_1 > 0$，$x_1 x_2 > 1$（即 $x_1 x_2 - 1 > 0$），且分母大于 $0$。\\n故 $f(x_1) - f(x_2) > 0$，即 $f(x_1) > f(x_2)$，所以 $f(x)$ 在 $[1, +\\\\infty)$ 上单调递减。\\n(3) 由(2)知 $f(x)$ 在 $[1, 3]$ 上单调递减，\\n故最大值为 $f(1) = \\\\frac{1}{2}$，最小值为 $f(3) = \\\\frac{3}{10}$。"}', '【得分要点】(1) 先验定义域对称性再算 $f(-x)$；(2) 用定义法作差通分因式分解出 $(x_2-x_1)(x_1x_2-1)$ 判号；(3) 准确求出 $\\frac{1}{2}$ 与 $\\frac{3}{10}$。', NULL, NULL, 3, '["定义法证单调性与奇偶性","手写解答","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"二次函数抛物线示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":26,"y1":148,"x2":294,"y2":148,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"arrow","x1":160,"y1":194,"x2":160,"y2":18,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":284,"y":154,"text":"x","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":167,"y":16,"text":"y","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":147,"y":153,"text":"O","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"polyline","points":[[78.8,25.4],[83.3,41.8],[87.8,57.2],[92.3,71.7],[96.8,85.2],[101.4,97.8],[105.9,109.5],[110.4,120.3],[114.9,130.1],[119.4,139],[123.9,146.9],[128.4,153.9],[132.9,160],[137.4,165.1],[142,169.3],[146.5,172.6],[151,174.9],[155.5,176.3],[160,176.8],[164.5,176.3],[169,174.9],[173.5,172.6],[178,169.3],[182.6,165.1],[187.1,160],[191.6,153.9],[196.1,146.9],[200.6,139],[205.1,130.1],[209.6,120.3],[214.1,109.5],[218.6,97.8],[223.2,85.2],[227.7,71.7],[232.2,57.2],[236.7,41.8],[241.2,25.4]],"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"line","x1":160,"y1":24,"x2":160,"y2":188,"color":"#DC2626","dashed":true},{"type":"point","x":160,"y":176.8,"label":"顶点","color":"#DC2626"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 104, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
