SELECT 'h1', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '已知定义在 $R$ 上的奇函数 $f(x)$ 满足 $f(x + 2) = -f(x)$，若 $f(1) = 3$，则 $f(2025)$ 的值为（  ）', '["$3$","$-3$","$0$","$1$"]', '{"index":0}', '由 $f(x+2)=-f(x)$ 得 $f(x+4)=f(x)$，周期为 $4$。因为 $2025 = 4 \\times 506 + 1$，所以 $f(2025) = f(1) = 3$。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["函数周期性与奇偶性","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"奇函数图象（关于原点对称）","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":26,"y1":108,"x2":294,"y2":108,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"arrow","x1":160,"y1":194,"x2":160,"y2":18,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":284,"y":114,"text":"x","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":167,"y":16,"text":"y","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":147,"y":113,"text":"O","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"polyline","points":[[91.2,180.4],[95,169],[98.8,158.8],[102.7,149.9],[106.5,142],[110.3,135.3],[114.1,129.4],[118,124.5],[121.8,120.4],[125.6,117],[129.4,114.4],[133.2,112.3],[137.1,110.7],[140.9,109.6],[144.7,108.8],[148.5,108.3],[152.4,108.1],[156.2,108],[160,108],[163.8,108],[167.6,107.9],[171.5,107.7],[175.3,107.2],[179.1,106.4],[182.9,105.3],[186.8,103.7],[190.6,101.6],[194.4,99],[198.2,95.6],[202,91.5],[205.9,86.6],[209.7,80.7],[213.5,74],[217.3,66.1],[221.2,57.2],[225,47],[228.8,35.6]],"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":211.2,"y":78.1,"label":"(x,f(x))","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":108.8,"y":137.9,"label":"(-x,-f(x))","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"line","x1":108.8,"y1":137.9,"x2":211.2,"y2":78.1,"color":"#64748B","dashed":true}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 102, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
