SELECT 'h1', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '已知函数 $f(x) = |\\mathrm{lg}\\,x|$，若 $0 < a < b$ 且 $f(a) = f(b)$，则 $a + 2b$ 的取值范围是（  ）', '["$(3, +\\\\infty)$","$(2\\\\sqrt{2}, +\\\\infty)$","$[2\\\\sqrt{2}, +\\\\infty)$","$[3, +\\\\infty)$"]', '{"index":0}', '由绝对值图象对称性知 $0 < a < 1 < b$ 且 $\\mathrm{lg}\\,a + \\mathrm{lg}\\,b = 0 \\Rightarrow ab = 1$（即 $a = \\frac{1}{b}$）。故 $a + 2b = 2b + \\frac{1}{b}$，该函数在对勾极值点 $b = \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} < 1$ 的右侧 $(1, +\\infty)$ 上严格单调递增，当 $b \\to 1$ 时值趋于 $3$，故取值范围是 $(3, +\\infty)$。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["绝对值对数与对勾陷阱","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"函数 f(x) = |lg x| 翻折图象","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":26,"y1":166,"x2":294,"y2":166,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"arrow","x1":48,"y1":194,"x2":48,"y2":18,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":284,"y":172,"text":"x","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":55,"y":16,"text":"y","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":35,"y":171,"text":"O","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"polyline","points":[[54.5,114.4],[56.3,120.5],[58.1,125.3],[60,129.3],[61.8,132.8],[63.6,135.8],[65.4,138.5],[67.3,140.9],[69.1,143.1],[70.9,145.2],[72.8,147],[74.6,148.8],[76.4,150.4],[78.2,151.9],[80.1,153.3],[81.9,154.7],[83.7,156],[85.6,157.2],[87.4,158.3],[89.2,159.4],[91,160.5],[92.9,161.5],[94.7,162.5],[96.5,163.4],[98.3,164.3],[100.2,165.2],[102,166]],"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"polyline","points":[[102,166],[109.1,163],[116.1,160.3],[123.2,158],[130.2,155.8],[137.3,153.8],[144.4,151.9],[151.4,150.2],[158.5,148.6],[165.6,147.1],[172.6,145.7],[179.7,144.3],[186.7,143.1],[193.8,141.8],[200.9,140.7],[207.9,139.6],[215,138.5],[222,137.5],[229.1,136.6],[236.2,135.6],[243.2,134.7],[250.3,133.9],[257.4,133],[264.4,132.2],[271.5,131.5],[278.5,130.7],[285.6,130]],"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"line","x1":48,"y1":138,"x2":286,"y2":138,"color":"#DC2626","dashed":true},{"type":"point","x":102,"y":166,"label":"1","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"point","x":65.28,"y":138,"label":"a","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":218.64000000000001,"y":138,"label":"b","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":206,"y":42,"text":"y = |lg x|","color":"#0284C7"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 102, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
