SELECT 'h1', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'ESSAY', '已知函数 $f(x) = \\mathrm{log}_a(x + 1) - \\mathrm{log}_a(1 - x)$（$a > 0$ 且 $a \\neq 1$）。\n(1) 求 $f(x)$ 的定义域；\n(2) 讨论函数 $f(x)$ 的单调性（需分 $a > 1$ 与 $0 < a < 1$ 讨论）；\n(3) 当 $a > 1$ 时，解不等式 $f(2x - 1) + f(x) > 0$。', '[]', '{"text":"解：\\n(1) 由 $\\\\begin{cases} x + 1 > 0 \\\\\\\\ 1 - x > 0 \\\\end{cases}$ 得 $-1 < x < 1$，故定义域为 $(-1, 1)$。\\n(2) $f(x) = \\\\mathrm{log}_a \\\\frac{1 + x}{1 - x} = \\\\mathrm{log}_a \\\\left(\\\\frac{2}{1 - x} - 1\\\\right)$。\\n因为内层函数 $u(x) = \\\\frac{2}{1 - x} - 1$ 在 $(-1, 1)$ 上单调递增：\\n当 $a > 1$ 时，外层对数函数递增，故 $f(x)$ 在 $(-1, 1)$ 上单调递增；\\n当 $0 < a < 1$ 时，外层对数函数递减，故 $f(x)$ 在 $(-1, 1)$ 上单调递减。\\n(3) 易验证 $f(-x) = -f(x)$，$f(x)$ 为奇函数。\\n不等式化为 $f(2x - 1) > -f(x) = f(-x)$。\\n因 $a > 1$ 时 $f(x)$ 在 $(-1, 1)$ 上单调递增，需满足：\\n$\\\\begin{cases} -1 < 2x - 1 < 1 \\\\\\\\ -1 < -x < 1 \\\\\\\\ 2x - 1 > -x \\\\end{cases}$\\n分别解得 $0 < x < 1$，$-1 < x < 1$，$x > \\\\frac{1}{3}$。\\n取交集得解集为 $\\\\left(\\\\frac{1}{3}, 1\\\\right)$。"}', '【得分要点】分 $a>1$ 与 $0<a<1$ 准确给出单调性；第(3)问利用奇偶性移项并紧扣定义域列三元不等式组求交集。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["对数含参单调性与奇偶解不等式","手写解答","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"对数函数图象与零点示意","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":26,"y1":148,"x2":294,"y2":148,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"arrow","x1":118,"y1":194,"x2":118,"y2":18,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":284,"y":154,"text":"x","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":125,"y":16,"text":"y","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":105,"y":153,"text":"O","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"polyline","points":[[129.2,199.6],[133.9,185.3],[138.7,174.7],[143.4,166.3],[148.2,159.4],[152.9,153.5],[157.7,148.3],[162.4,143.8],[167.2,139.7],[171.9,135.9],[176.7,132.5],[181.4,129.4],[186.2,126.5],[190.9,123.7],[195.7,121.2],[200.4,118.8],[205.2,116.5],[210,114.4],[214.7,112.3],[219.5,110.4],[224.2,108.6],[229,106.8],[233.7,105.1],[238.5,103.5],[243.2,101.9],[248,100.4],[252.7,98.9],[257.5,97.5],[262.2,96.2],[267,94.9],[271.7,93.6],[276.5,92.4],[281.2,91.2],[286,90]],"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":158,"y":148,"label":"(1,0)","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":218,"y":46,"text":"y = log_a x","color":"#0284C7"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 105, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
