SELECT 'h1', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'ESSAY', '已知函数 $f(x) = \\mathrm{sin}\\,2x + \\sqrt{3}\\mathrm{cos}\\,2x$。\n(1) 利用辅助角公式将 $f(x)$ 化为 $A\\mathrm{sin}\\,(\\omega x + \\varphi)$ 的形式；\n(2) 求函数 $f(x)$ 的单调递增区间；\n(3) 求当 $x \\in [0, \\frac{\\pi}{2}]$ 时，$f(x)$ 的值域。', '[]', '{"text":"解：\\n(1) $f(x) = 2\\\\left(\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,2x + \\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\\\mathrm{cos}\\\\,2x\\\\right) = 2\\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,\\\\left(2x + \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}\\\\right)$。\\n(2) 令 $-\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2} + 2k\\\\pi \\\\le 2x + \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3} \\\\le \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2} + 2k\\\\pi$（$k \\\\in Z$），\\n解得 $-\\\\frac{5\\\\pi}{12} + k\\\\pi \\\\le x \\\\le \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{12} + k\\\\pi$（$k \\\\in Z$）。\\n所以单调递增区间为 $\\\\left[-\\\\frac{5\\\\pi}{12} + k\\\\pi, \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{12} + k\\\\pi\\\\right]$（$k \\\\in Z$）。\\n(3) 当 $x \\\\in [0, \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}]$ 时，$2x + \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3} \\\\in [\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}, \\\\frac{4\\\\pi}{3}]$。\\n在此区间内 $\\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,(2x+\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3})$ 的最大值为 $\\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2} = 1$，最小值为 $\\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,\\\\frac{4\\\\pi}{3} = -\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{3}}{2}$。\\n故 $f(x)$ 的值域为 $[-\\\\sqrt{3}, 2]$。"}', '【得分要点】正确用辅助角公式化一，整体代换求增区间不漏 $k\\in Z$，闭区间值域抓住端点与峰谷位置。', NULL, NULL, 3, '["辅助角化一与单调值域","手写解答","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"正弦函数 y = A sin(ωx+φ) 波形示意","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":26,"y1":108,"x2":294,"y2":108,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"arrow","x1":46,"y1":194,"x2":46,"y2":18,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":284,"y":114,"text":"x","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":53,"y":16,"text":"y","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":33,"y":113,"text":"O","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"polyline","points":[[46,108],[50.8,100.4],[55.6,93],[60.4,85.8],[65.2,79],[70,72.7],[74.8,67],[79.5,62],[84.3,57.8],[89.1,54.4],[93.9,52],[98.7,50.5],[103.5,50],[108.3,50.5],[113.1,52],[117.9,54.4],[122.7,57.8],[127.5,62],[132.3,67],[137,72.7],[141.8,79],[146.6,85.8],[151.4,93],[156.2,100.4],[161,108],[165.8,115.6],[170.6,123],[175.4,130.2],[180.2,137],[185,143.3],[189.8,149],[194.5,154],[199.3,158.2],[204.1,161.6],[208.9,164],[213.7,165.5],[218.5,166],[223.3,165.5],[228.1,164],[232.9,161.6],[237.7,158.2],[242.5,154],[247.3,149],[252,143.3],[256.8,137],[261.6,130.2],[266.4,123],[271.2,115.6],[276,108]],"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"text","x":98,"y":34,"text":"A","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":272,"y":118,"text":"T","color":"#0284C7"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 104, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
