SELECT 'h1', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'ESSAY', '已知 $\\alpha, \\beta$ 均为锐角，且 $\\mathrm{sin}\\,\\alpha = \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}$，$\\mathrm{cos}\\,\\beta = \\frac{3\\sqrt{10}}{10}$。\n(1) 求 $\\mathrm{cos}\\,2\\alpha$ 与 $\\mathrm{tan}\\,(\\alpha + \\beta)$ 的值；\n(2) 求 $\\alpha + \\beta$ 的值。', '[]', '{"text":"解：\\n(1) 因为 $\\\\alpha$ 为锐角，$\\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,\\\\alpha = \\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{5}}{5}$，所以 $\\\\mathrm{cos}\\\\,\\\\alpha = \\\\sqrt{1 - \\\\frac{1}{5}} = \\\\frac{2\\\\sqrt{5}}{5}$，$\\\\mathrm{tan}\\\\,\\\\alpha = \\\\frac{1}{2}$。\\n$\\\\mathrm{cos}\\\\,2\\\\alpha = 1 - 2\\\\mathrm{sin}^2\\\\alpha = 1 - 2 \\\\times \\\\frac{1}{5} = \\\\frac{3}{5}$。\\n因为 $\\\\beta$ 为锐角，$\\\\mathrm{cos}\\\\,\\\\beta = \\\\frac{3\\\\sqrt{10}}{10}$，所以 $\\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,\\\\beta = \\\\sqrt{1 - \\\\frac{9}{10}} = \\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{10}}{10}$，$\\\\mathrm{tan}\\\\,\\\\beta = \\\\frac{1}{3}$。\\n因此 $\\\\mathrm{tan}\\\\,(\\\\alpha + \\\\beta) = \\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{tan}\\\\,\\\\alpha + \\\\mathrm{tan}\\\\,\\\\beta}{1 - \\\\mathrm{tan}\\\\,\\\\alpha\\\\mathrm{tan}\\\\,\\\\beta} = \\\\frac{\\\\frac{1}{2} + \\\\frac{1}{3}}{1 - \\\\frac{1}{6}} = \\\\frac{\\\\frac{5}{6}}{\\\\frac{5}{6}} = 1$。\\n(2) 因为 $\\\\alpha, \\\\beta \\\\in (0, \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2})$，且 $\\\\mathrm{tan}\\\\,\\\\alpha = \\\\frac{1}{2} < 1$、$\\\\mathrm{tan}\\\\,\\\\beta = \\\\frac{1}{3} < 1$，所以 $0 < \\\\alpha, \\\\beta < \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}$，故 $0 < \\\\alpha + \\\\beta < \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}$。\\n又 $\\\\mathrm{tan}\\\\,(\\\\alpha + \\\\beta) = 1$，所以 $\\\\alpha + \\\\beta = \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}$。"}', '【得分要点】准确求 $\\mathrm{tan}\\,\\alpha=\\frac{1}{2}, \\mathrm{tan}\\,\\beta=\\frac{1}{3}$ 并用两角和公式算出 $1$；给角时必须缩小角度范围至 $(0, \\frac{\\pi}{2})$ 方可唯一定角为 $\\frac{\\pi}{4}$。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["给值求角与缩小角范围","手写解答","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"正弦函数 y = A sin(ωx+φ) 波形示意","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":26,"y1":108,"x2":294,"y2":108,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"arrow","x1":46,"y1":194,"x2":46,"y2":18,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":284,"y":114,"text":"x","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":53,"y":16,"text":"y","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":33,"y":113,"text":"O","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"polyline","points":[[46,108],[50.8,100.4],[55.6,93],[60.4,85.8],[65.2,79],[70,72.7],[74.8,67],[79.5,62],[84.3,57.8],[89.1,54.4],[93.9,52],[98.7,50.5],[103.5,50],[108.3,50.5],[113.1,52],[117.9,54.4],[122.7,57.8],[127.5,62],[132.3,67],[137,72.7],[141.8,79],[146.6,85.8],[151.4,93],[156.2,100.4],[161,108],[165.8,115.6],[170.6,123],[175.4,130.2],[180.2,137],[185,143.3],[189.8,149],[194.5,154],[199.3,158.2],[204.1,161.6],[208.9,164],[213.7,165.5],[218.5,166],[223.3,165.5],[228.1,164],[232.9,161.6],[237.7,158.2],[242.5,154],[247.3,149],[252,143.3],[256.8,137],[261.6,130.2],[266.4,123],[271.2,115.6],[276,108]],"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"text","x":98,"y":34,"text":"A","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":272,"y":118,"text":"T","color":"#0284C7"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 105, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
