SELECT 'h1', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'ESSAY', '已知 $|a| = 1$，$|b| = 2$，且 $a$ 与 $b$ 的夹角为 $\\frac{\\pi}{3}$。\n(1) 求 $a \\cdot b$ 及 $|a + b|$；\n(2) 若 $(a + kb) \\perp (a - b)$，求实数 $k$ 的值。', '[]', '{"text":"解：\\n(1) $a \\\\cdot b = |a||b|\\\\mathrm{cos}\\\\,\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3} = 1 \\\\times 2 \\\\times \\\\frac{1}{2} = 1$。\\n$|a + b| = \\\\sqrt{|a|^2 + 2a\\\\cdot b + |b|^2} = \\\\sqrt{1 + 2 \\\\times 1 + 4} = \\\\sqrt{7}$。\\n(2) 因为 $(a + kb) \\\\perp (a - b)$，所以 $(a + kb) \\\\cdot (a - b) = 0$。\\n展开得 $|a|^2 + (k - 1)a \\\\cdot b - k|b|^2 = 0$，\\n代入得 $1 + (k - 1)\\\\times 1 - 4k = 0$，\\n解得 $-3k = 0 \\\\Rightarrow k = 0$。"}', '【得分要点】求模先平方；展开数量积代入 $|a|^2=1, |b|^2=4, a\\cdot b=1$，算准系数求得 $k=0$。', NULL, NULL, 3, '["向量模长与垂直求参","手写解答","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"平面向量夹角与垂直模型","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":66,"y1":158,"x2":246,"y2":158,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"arrow","x1":66,"y1":158,"x2":126,"y2":68,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"arc","cx":66,"cy":158,"r":34,"startAngle":-56,"sweepAngle":56,"color":"#D97706"},{"type":"point","x":66,"y":158,"label":"O","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":148,"y":166,"text":"|b| = 2","color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"text","x":68,"y":98,"text":"|a| = 1","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":104,"y":134,"text":"π/3","color":"#D97706"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 104, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
