SELECT 'h1', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '计算 $1 + i + i^2 + i^3 + \\dots + i^{2026}$ 的结果为（  ）', '["$i$","$0$","$1 + i$","$-i$"]', '{"index":0}', '因为连续 $4$ 项和 $i^k + i^{k+1} + i^{k+2} + i^{k+3} = 0$，共 $2027$ 项，$2027 = 4\\times 506 + 3$，余下前三项 $1 + i + i^2 = i$。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["i的幂求和周期","TASK-20261122-002"]', NULL, 'ADMIN', 1, 102, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
