SELECT 'h1', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'ESSAY', '已知复数 $z$ 满足 $|z| = 1$，且复数 $\\omega = z + \\frac{4}{z}$ 在复平面内对应点 $P(x, y)$。\n(1) 请用三角或代数方法证明当 $z = \\mathrm{cos}\\,\\theta + i\\,\\mathrm{sin}\\,\\theta$ 时，$x = 5\\mathrm{cos}\\,\\theta$，$y = -3\\mathrm{sin}\\,\\theta$；\n(2) 当 $z = i$ 时，求 $|z - 3 - 4i|$ 的值。', '[]', '{"text":"解：\\n(1) 因为 $|z| = 1$ 且 $z = \\\\mathrm{cos}\\\\,\\\\theta + i\\\\,\\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,\\\\theta$，\\n所以 $\\\\frac{1}{z} = \\\\bar{z} = \\\\mathrm{cos}\\\\,\\\\theta - i\\\\,\\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,\\\\theta$。\\n代入 $\\\\omega = z + \\\\frac{4}{z} = (\\\\mathrm{cos}\\\\,\\\\theta + i\\\\,\\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,\\\\theta) + 4(\\\\mathrm{cos}\\\\,\\\\theta - i\\\\,\\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,\\\\theta) = 5\\\\mathrm{cos}\\\\,\\\\theta - 3i\\\\,\\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,\\\\theta$。\\n对比实部与虚部，即得 $x = 5\\\\mathrm{cos}\\\\,\\\\theta$，$y = -3\\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,\\\\theta$。\\n(2) 当 $z = i$ 时，$z - 3 - 4i = -3 - 3i$，\\n所以 $|z - 3 - 4i| = \\\\sqrt{(-3)^2 + (-3)^2} = \\\\sqrt{18} = 3\\\\sqrt{2}$。"}', '【得分要点】(1) 利用单位圆上复数倒数等于共轭的性质 $\\frac{1}{z}=\\bar{z}$ 迅速导出实虚部关系；(2) 准确求模 $3\\sqrt{2}$。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["单位复数共轭倒数性质","手写解答","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"复平面点 Z(a, b) 与模长 |z|","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":26,"y1":112,"x2":294,"y2":112,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"arrow","x1":142,"y1":194,"x2":142,"y2":18,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":284,"y":118,"text":"x","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":149,"y":16,"text":"y","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":129,"y":117,"text":"O","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"arrow","x1":142,"y1":112,"x2":224,"y2":56,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"line","x1":224,"y1":56,"x2":224,"y2":112,"color":"#64748B","dashed":true},{"type":"line","x1":224,"y1":56,"x2":142,"y2":56,"color":"#64748B","dashed":true},{"type":"point","x":224,"y":56,"label":"Z(a,b)","color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"text","x":228,"y":120,"text":"a","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":124,"y":50,"text":"b","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":176,"y":72,"text":"|z|","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":254,"y":94,"text":"实轴","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":150,"y":22,"text":"虚轴","color":"#64748B"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 105, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
