SELECT 'h1', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'ESSAY', '在四棱锥 $P-ABCD$ 中，底面 $ABCD$ 为矩形，$PA \\perp$ 平面 $ABCD$，$E$ 为 $PD$ 的中点。\n(1) 求证：$PB \\parallel$ 平面 $AEC$；\n(2) 求证：平面 $PCD \\perp$ 平面 $PAD$。', '[]', '{"text":"证明：\\n(1) 连接 $BD$ 交 $AC$ 于点 $O$，连接 $EO$。\\n因为底面 $ABCD$ 是矩形，所以 $O$ 是 $BD$ 的中点。\\n又因为 $E$ 是 $PD$ 的中点，所以 $EO$ 是 $\\\\triangle PBD$ 的中位线，故 $EO \\\\parallel PB$。\\n又 $EO \\\\subset$ 平面 $AEC$，$PB \\\\not\\\\subset$ 平面 $AEC$，\\n所以 $PB \\\\parallel$ 平面 $AEC$。\\n(2) 因为 $PA \\\\perp$ 平面 $ABCD$，$CD \\\\subset$ 平面 $ABCD$，所以 $PA \\\\perp CD$。\\n因为 $ABCD$ 为矩形，所以 $AD \\\\perp CD$。\\n又 $PA \\\\cap AD = A$，且 $PA, AD \\\\subset$ 平面 $PAD$，\\n所以 $CD \\\\perp$ 平面 $PAD$。\\n又因为 $CD \\\\subset$ 平面 $PCD$，所以平面 $PCD \\\\perp$ 平面 $PAD$。"}', '【得分要点】(1) 构造矩形中心与中位线利用线面平行判定定理；(2) 先证线面垂直 $CD \\perp$ 平面 $PAD$，再证面面垂直。', NULL, NULL, 3, '["线面平行与面面垂直证明","手写解答","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"棱锥空间示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"line","x1":160,"y1":24,"x2":72,"y2":164,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":160,"y1":24,"x2":206,"y2":180,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":160,"y1":24,"x2":258,"y2":146,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":160,"y1":24,"x2":128,"y2":134,"color":"#64748B","dashed":true},{"type":"line","x1":72,"y1":164,"x2":206,"y2":180,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":206,"y1":180,"x2":258,"y2":146,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":72,"y1":164,"x2":128,"y2":134,"color":"#64748B","dashed":true},{"type":"line","x1":128,"y1":134,"x2":258,"y2":146,"color":"#64748B","dashed":true},{"type":"line","x1":160,"y1":24,"x2":162,"y2":154,"color":"#DC2626","dashed":true},{"type":"text","x":154,"y":6,"text":"P","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":56,"y":166,"text":"A","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":206,"y":184,"text":"B","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":262,"y":142,"text":"C","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":114,"y":128,"text":"D","color":"#64748B"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 104, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
