SELECT 'h1', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'ESSAY', '某市为了解居民每月用电量，随机抽取了 $100$ 户居民进行调查，将数据分成 $6$ 组：$[50, 100)$ 占 $10\\%$，$[100, 150)$ 占 $20\\%$，$[150, 200)$ 占 $30\\%$，$[200, 250)$ 占 $24\\%$，$[250, 300)$ 占 $10\\%$，$[300, 350]$ 占 $6\\%$。\n(1) 估计该样本数据的第 $80$ 百分位数；\n(2) 若该市计划对月用电量在前 $80\\%$ 以内的居民实行第一档优惠电价，请根据上述调查结果确定第一档的月用电量上限标准（约为多少度）。', '[]', '{"text":"解：\\n(1) 各组累计百分比分别为：\\n$10\\\\%$（至 $100$），$30\\\\%$（至 $150$），$60\\\\%$（至 $200$），$84\\\\%$（至 $250$）。\\n可见第 $80$ 百分位数落在 $[200, 250)$ 内。\\n设其为 $P_{80}$，由比例插值：\\n$0.60 + \\\\frac{P_{80} - 200}{50} \\\\times 0.24 = 0.80$\\n$\\\\Rightarrow \\\\frac{P_{80} - 200}{50} = \\\\frac{0.20}{0.24} = \\\\frac{5}{6}$\\n$\\\\Rightarrow P_{80} = 200 + \\\\frac{250}{6} = 200 + 41\\\\frac{2}{3} \\\\approx 241.7$（度）。\\n(2) 若取约数或整数标准，第一档电价月用电量上限可定在 $242$ 度（或 $240$ 度）左右。"}', '【得分要点】准确算出各段累计频率锁定区间 $[200, 250)$，通过直方图插值算出约 $241.7$ 度并给出合理的决策上限。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["百分位数与阶梯电价决策","手写解答","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"居民月用电量 6 组频率分布图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":36,"y1":166,"x2":298,"y2":166,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"arrow","x1":36,"y1":166,"x2":36,"y2":22,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":12,"y":20,"text":"占比","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"polygon","points":[[48,166],[48,132],[86,132],[86,166]],"color":"#0284C7","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"text","x":52,"y":117,"text":"10%","color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"text","x":44,"y":172,"text":"50","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"polygon","points":[[88,166],[88,98],[126,98],[126,166]],"color":"#0284C7","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"text","x":92,"y":83,"text":"20%","color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"text","x":84,"y":172,"text":"100","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"polygon","points":[[128,166],[128,64],[166,64],[166,166]],"color":"#0284C7","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"text","x":132,"y":49,"text":"30%","color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"text","x":124,"y":172,"text":"150","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"polygon","points":[[168,166],[168,84],[206,84],[206,166]],"color":"#0284C7","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"text","x":172,"y":69,"text":"24%","color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"text","x":164,"y":172,"text":"200","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"polygon","points":[[208,166],[208,132],[246,132],[246,166]],"color":"#0284C7","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"text","x":212,"y":117,"text":"10%","color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"text","x":204,"y":172,"text":"250","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"polygon","points":[[248,166],[248,144],[286,144],[286,166]],"color":"#0284C7","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"text","x":252,"y":129,"text":"6%","color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"text","x":244,"y":172,"text":"300","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":280,"y":172,"text":"350","color":"#64748B"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 105, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
