SELECT 'h1', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '某种元件正常工作的概率为 $0.9$。现将两个该元件**并联**接入电路（只要至少一个正常工作，电路就能通电），若元件之间相互独立，则该并联电路正常通电的概率是（  ）', '["$0.99$","$0.81$","$0.9$","$0.95$"]', '{"index":0}', '电路不通电当且仅当两个元件都失效，失效概率 $= 0.1 \\times 0.1 = 0.01$，故通电概率 $= 1 - 0.01 = 0.99$。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["并联电路可靠性","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"双元件并联电路示意（各 P = 0.9）","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"line","x1":36,"y1":108,"x2":92,"y2":108,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":228,"y1":108,"x2":284,"y2":108,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":92,"y1":62,"x2":92,"y2":154,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":228,"y1":62,"x2":228,"y2":154,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":92,"y1":62,"x2":126,"y2":62,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":194,"y1":62,"x2":228,"y2":62,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":92,"y1":154,"x2":126,"y2":154,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":194,"y1":154,"x2":228,"y2":154,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"polygon","points":[[126,46],[194,46],[194,78],[126,78]],"color":"#0284C7","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"polygon","points":[[126,138],[194,138],[194,170],[126,170]],"color":"#059669","fillColor":"#34D399"},{"type":"point","x":36,"y":108,"label":"A","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"point","x":284,"y":108,"label":"B","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":134,"y":54,"text":"元件 1","color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"text","x":134,"y":146,"text":"元件 2","color":"#059669"},{"type":"text","x":136,"y":98,"text":"并联","color":"#DC2626"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 101, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
