SELECT 'h2', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'DYNAMIC_TEMPLATE', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '已知直线 $l$ 的方向向量 $u = (1, 0, 1)$，平面 $\\alpha$ 的法向量 $n = (1, {{a}}, 1)$? 取常见算得整角：若直线方向向量与法向量夹角余弦的绝对值为 $\\frac{1}{2}$，则直线 $l$ 与平面 $\\alpha$ 所成角 $\\theta$ 的正弦值为 $\\frac{1}{2}$；若方向向量 $u = ({{a}}, 0, 0)$ 与平面的法向量 $n = (1, \\sqrt{3}, 0)$ 成 $60^\\circ$（余弦 $\\frac{1}{2}$），则线面角 $\\theta$ 等于（  ）度', '[]', '{"index":0}', '线面角 $\\theta$ 满足 $\\mathrm{sin}\\,\\theta = |\\mathrm{cos}\\,\\langle u, n \\rangle| = \\frac{1}{2}$，因为 $\\theta \\in [0^\\circ, 90^\\circ]$，故 $\\theta = 30^\\circ$。', NULL, '{"type":"PARAM_TEMPLATE","vars":{"a":[1,5]},"stemTpl":"已知直线 $l$ 的方向向量 $u = (1, 0, 1)$，平面 $\\\\alpha$ 的法向量 $n = (1, {{a}}, 1)$? 取常见算得整角：若直线方向向量与法向量夹角余弦的绝对值为 $\\\\frac{1}{2}$，则直线 $l$ 与平面 $\\\\alpha$ 所成角 $\\\\theta$ 的正弦值为 $\\\\frac{1}{2}$；若方向向量 $u = ({{a}}, 0, 0)$ 与平面的法向量 $n = (1, \\\\sqrt{3}, 0)$ 成 $60^\\\\circ$（余弦 $\\\\frac{1}{2}$），则线面角 $\\\\theta$ 等于（  ）度","ansExpr":"30","wrongExprs":["60","45","15"]}', 2, '["空间向量求线面角","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"正方体/长方体示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"polygon","points":[[82,72],[198,72],[198,174],[82,174]],"color":"#1E293B","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"line","x1":82,"y1":72,"x2":130,"y2":36,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":198,"y1":72,"x2":246,"y2":36,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":130,"y1":36,"x2":246,"y2":36,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":246,"y1":36,"x2":246,"y2":138,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":198,"y1":174,"x2":246,"y2":138,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":130,"y1":36,"x2":130,"y2":138,"color":"#64748B","dashed":true},{"type":"line","x1":82,"y1":174,"x2":130,"y2":138,"color":"#64748B","dashed":true},{"type":"line","x1":130,"y1":138,"x2":246,"y2":138,"color":"#64748B","dashed":true}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 104, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
