SELECT 'h2', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'ESSAY', '如图，在正方体 $ABCD-A_1B_1C_1D_1$ 中，棱长为 $2$，$E$ 为 $DD_1$ 的中点。\n请建立适当的空间直角坐标系，用空间向量的方法解答：\n(1) 求证：$BD_1 \\parallel$ 平面 $EAC$（利用法向量或共面验证）；\n(2) 求直线 $BD_1$ 与直线 $CE$ 所成角的余弦值。', '[]', '{"text":"解：\\n以 $D$ 为坐标原点，分别以 $DA, DC, DD_1$ 所在直线为 $x, y, z$ 轴建立空间直角坐标系。\\n各点坐标为：$D(0,0,0)$，$A(2,0,0)$，$B(2,2,0)$，$C(0,2,0)$，$D_1(0,0,2)$，$E(0,0,1)$。\\n(1) $\\\\overrightarrow{EA} = (2, 0, -1)$，$\\\\overrightarrow{EC} = (0, 2, -1)$，$\\\\overrightarrow{BD_1} = (-2, -2, 2)$。\\n设平面 $EAC$ 的法向量为 $n = (x, y, z)$，则 $\\\\begin{cases} 2x - z = 0 \\\\\\\\ 2y - z = 0 \\\\end{cases}$。\\n取 $x = 1$，则 $y = 1$，$z = 2$，得 $n = (1, 1, 2)$。\\n计算 $n \\\\cdot \\\\overrightarrow{BD_1} = 1\\\\times(-2) + 1\\\\times(-2) + 2\\\\times 2 = 0$，即 $n \\\\perp \\\\overrightarrow{BD_1}$。\\n又 $BD_1 \\\\not\\\\subset$ 平面 $EAC$，故 $BD_1 \\\\parallel$ 平面 $EAC$。\\n(2) $\\\\overrightarrow{CE} = (0, -2, 1)$，$|\\\\overrightarrow{CE}| = \\\\sqrt{5}$，$|\\\\overrightarrow{BD_1}| = \\\\sqrt{(-2)^2+(-2)^2+2^2} = 2\\\\sqrt{3}$。\\n$\\\\overrightarrow{BD_1} \\\\cdot \\\\overrightarrow{CE} = (-2)\\\\times 0 + (-2)\\\\times(-2) + 2\\\\times 1 = 6$。\\n故所成角的余弦值 $\\\\mathrm{cos}\\\\,\\\\theta = \\\\frac{|\\\\overrightarrow{BD_1} \\\\cdot \\\\overrightarrow{CE}|}{|\\\\overrightarrow{BD_1}| |\\\\overrightarrow{CE}|} = \\\\frac{6}{2\\\\sqrt{3}\\\\cdot \\\\sqrt{5}} = \\\\frac{3}{\\\\sqrt{15}} = \\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{15}}{5}$。"}', '【得分要点】(1) 建系写准坐标、求出法向量 $n=(1,1,2)$ 并验证点积为 $0$ 且线在面外；(2) 求异面直线夹角余弦必须取绝对值并有理化得 $\\frac{\\sqrt{15}}{5}$。', NULL, NULL, 3, '["空间向量建系证平行与异面角","手写解答","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"正方体 ABCD-A₁B₁C₁D₁","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"polygon","points":[[76,72],[186,72],[186,174],[76,174]],"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":76,"y1":72,"x2":126,"y2":36,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":186,"y1":72,"x2":236,"y2":36,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":126,"y1":36,"x2":236,"y2":36,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":236,"y1":36,"x2":236,"y2":138,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":186,"y1":174,"x2":236,"y2":138,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"line","x1":126,"y1":36,"x2":126,"y2":138,"color":"#64748B","dashed":true},{"type":"line","x1":76,"y1":174,"x2":126,"y2":138,"color":"#64748B","dashed":true},{"type":"line","x1":126,"y1":138,"x2":236,"y2":138,"color":"#64748B","dashed":true},{"type":"line","x1":186,"y1":174,"x2":126,"y2":36,"color":"#0284C7","dashed":true},{"type":"line","x1":236,"y1":138,"x2":126,"y2":87,"color":"#DC2626","dashed":true},{"type":"point","x":126,"y":87,"label":"E","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":60,"y":174,"text":"A","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":190,"y":176,"text":"B","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":242,"y":136,"text":"C","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":112,"y":134,"text":"D","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":56,"y":62,"text":"A₁","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":190,"y":66,"text":"B₁","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":240,"y":26,"text":"C₁","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":114,"y":18,"text":"D₁","color":"#1E293B"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 104, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
