SELECT 'h2', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '直线 $l: y = x + 1$ 被圆 $C: (x - 1)^2 + y^2 = 4$ 所截得的弦长为（  ）', '["$2\\\\sqrt{2}$","$2$","$4$","$\\\\sqrt{2}$"]', '{"index":0}', '圆心 $(1, 0)$ 到直线 $x - y + 1 = 0$ 的距离 $d = \\frac{|1 - 0 + 1|}{\\sqrt{2}} = \\sqrt{2}$，半径 $r = 2$，故半弦长 $= \\sqrt{2^2 - (\\sqrt{2})^2} = \\sqrt{2}$，弦长为 $2\\sqrt{2}$。', NULL, NULL, 3, '["直线与圆弦长公式","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"直线与圆的位置关系示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"circle","cx":138,"cy":108,"r":62,"color":"#1E293B","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"line","x1":138,"y1":108,"x2":186,"y2":68,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"line","x1":72,"y1":30,"x2":266,"y2":176,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"rightAngle","vx":186,"vy":68,"ax":138,"ay":108,"bx":266,"by":176,"size":9,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":138,"y":108,"label":"C","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":158,"y":76,"text":"d","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":244,"y":148,"text":"l","color":"#0284C7"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 101, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
