SELECT 'h2', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '圆 $C_1: x^2 + y^2 = 4$ 与圆 $C_2: (x - 3)^2 + (y - 4)^2 = 9$ 的公切线条数为（  ）', '["$3$ 条","$2$ 条","$4$ 条","$1$ 条"]', '{"index":0}', '两圆圆心距 $d = \\sqrt{3^2 + 4^2} = 5$，半径分别为 $r_1 = 2$、$r_2 = 3$。因为 $d = r_1 + r_2 = 5$，所以两圆外切，共有 $3$ 条公切线（$2$ 条外公切线与 $1$ 条内公切线）。', NULL, NULL, 3, '["两圆位置关系与公切线","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"直线与圆的位置关系示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"circle","cx":138,"cy":108,"r":62,"color":"#1E293B","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"line","x1":138,"y1":108,"x2":186,"y2":68,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"line","x1":72,"y1":30,"x2":266,"y2":176,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"rightAngle","vx":186,"vy":68,"ax":138,"ay":108,"bx":266,"by":176,"size":9,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":138,"y":108,"label":"C","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":158,"y":76,"text":"d","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":244,"y":148,"text":"l","color":"#0284C7"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 102, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
