SELECT 'h2', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '直线 $l: mx - y + 1 - 2m = 0$ 与圆 $C: x^2 + y^2 = 9$ 的位置关系是（  ）', '["相交","相切","相离","随 $m$ 变化而变化"]', '{"index":0}', '直线 $m(x - 2) + (1 - y) = 0$ 恒过定点 $P(2, 1)$；而 $2^2 + 1^2 = 5 < 9$，定点在圆内，故直线与圆恒相交！', NULL, NULL, 4, '["过定点直线与圆恒相交","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"直线与圆的位置关系示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"circle","cx":138,"cy":108,"r":62,"color":"#1E293B","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"line","x1":138,"y1":108,"x2":186,"y2":68,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"line","x1":72,"y1":30,"x2":266,"y2":176,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"rightAngle","vx":186,"vy":68,"ax":138,"ay":108,"bx":266,"by":176,"size":9,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":138,"y":108,"label":"C","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":158,"y":76,"text":"d","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":244,"y":148,"text":"l","color":"#0284C7"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 102, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
