SELECT 'h2', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'ESSAY', '已知椭圆 $C: \\frac{x^2}{a^2} + \\frac{y^2}{b^2} = 1$（$a > b > 0$）的离心率为 $\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$，且椭圆经过点 $(\\sqrt{2}, 1)$。\n(1) 求椭圆 $C$ 的标准方程；\n(2) 若斜率为 $1$ 的直线 $l$ 与椭圆 $C$ 交于 $A, B$ 两点，且线段 $AB$ 的中点为 $M$，用点差法求点 $M$ 所在直线的斜率（即 $k_{OM}$ 的值）。', '[]', '{"text":"解：\\n(1) 因为 $e = \\\\frac{c}{a} = \\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2}}{2}$，所以 $a^2 = 2c^2 = 2(a^2 - b^2) \\\\Rightarrow a^2 = 2b^2$。\\n将点 $(\\\\sqrt{2}, 1)$ 代入 $\\\\frac{x^2}{2b^2} + \\\\frac{y^2}{b^2} = 1$，得 $\\\\frac{2}{2b^2} + \\\\frac{1}{b^2} = 1 \\\\Rightarrow \\\\frac{2}{b^2} = 1 \\\\Rightarrow b^2 = 2$，\\n故 $a^2 = 4$，椭圆方程为 $\\\\frac{x^2}{4} + \\\\frac{y^2}{2} = 1$。\\n(2) 设 $A(x_1, y_1)$，$B(x_2, y_2)$，中点 $M(x_0, y_0)$（$x_0 \\\\neq 0$）。\\n两式作差：$\\\\frac{x_1^2 - x_2^2}{4} + \\\\frac{y_1^2 - y_2^2}{2} = 0$，\\n即 $\\\\frac{(x_1+x_2)(x_1-x_2)}{4} + \\\\frac{(y_1+y_2)(y_1-y_2)}{2} = 0$。\\n两边同除以 $(x_1 - x_2)$ 并代入 $x_1+x_2 = 2x_0$，$y_1+y_2 = 2y_0$，$k_{AB} = 1$：\\n$\\\\frac{2x_0}{4} + \\\\frac{2y_0}{2} \\\\cdot 1 = 0 \\\\Rightarrow \\\\frac{x_0}{2} + y_0 = 0 \\\\Rightarrow k_{OM} = \\\\frac{y_0}{x_0} = -\\\\frac{1}{2}$。"}', '【得分要点】(1) 利用离心率得 $a^2=2b^2$ 求标准方程；(2) 熟练运用“点差法”推导出 $k_{OM} \\cdot k_{AB} = -\\frac{b^2}{a^2} = -\\frac{1}{2}$。', NULL, NULL, 3, '["椭圆标准方程与点差法","手写解答","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"椭圆焦点与标准方程示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":24,"y1":108,"x2":296,"y2":108,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"arrow","x1":160,"y1":194,"x2":160,"y2":18,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":286,"y":114,"text":"x","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":167,"y":16,"text":"y","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":147,"y":113,"text":"O","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"polyline","points":[[256,108],[255.2,115.3],[252.7,122.5],[248.7,129.4],[243.1,136],[236.2,142.1],[227.9,147.6],[218.4,152.4],[208,156.5],[196.7,159.7],[184.8,162.1],[172.5,163.5],[160,164],[147.5,163.5],[135.2,162.1],[123.3,159.7],[112,156.5],[101.6,152.4],[92.1,147.6],[83.8,142.1],[76.9,136],[71.3,129.4],[67.3,122.5],[64.8,115.3],[64,108],[64.8,100.7],[67.3,93.5],[71.3,86.6],[76.9,80],[83.8,73.9],[92.1,68.4],[101.6,63.6],[112,59.5],[123.3,56.3],[135.2,53.9],[147.5,52.5],[160,52],[172.5,52.5],[184.8,53.9],[196.7,56.3],[208,59.5],[218.4,63.6],[227.9,68.4],[236.2,73.9],[243.1,80],[248.7,86.6],[252.7,93.5],[255.2,100.7],[256,108]],"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":82,"y":108,"label":"F₁","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":238,"y":108,"label":"F₂","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":202,"y":58,"label":"P","color":"#059669"},{"type":"line","x1":82,"y1":108,"x2":202,"y2":58,"color":"#059669","dashed":true},{"type":"line","x1":238,"y1":108,"x2":202,"y2":58,"color":"#059669","dashed":true}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 104, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
