SELECT 'h2', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'ESSAY', '已知抛物线 $C: y^2 = 4x$ 的焦点为 $F$，过点 $F$ 的直线 $l$ 与抛物线 $C$ 交于 $A, B$ 两点。\n(1) 若直线 $l$ 的倾斜角为 $45^\\circ$，求弦长 $|AB|$；\n(2) 求证：无论直线 $l$ 的倾斜角如何变化（不与 $x$ 轴平行），$\\overrightarrow{OA} \\cdot \\overrightarrow{OB}$ 为定值，并求出该定值。', '[]', '{"text":"解：\\n(1) 焦点 $F(1, 0)$，倾斜角 $45^\\\\circ$ 时斜率 $k = 1$，直线 $l$ 为 $y = x - 1$。\\n联立 $\\\\begin{cases} y = x - 1 \\\\\\\\ y^2 = 4x \\\\end{cases}$ 消去 $y$，得 $(x - 1)^2 = 4x \\\\Rightarrow x^2 - 6x + 1 = 0$。\\n由韦达定理 $x_1 + x_2 = 6$，由抛物线焦点弦公式 $|AB| = x_1 + x_2 + p = 6 + 2 = 8$。\\n(2) 设直线 $l$ 的方程为 $x = my + 1$，代入 $y^2 = 4x$ 得 $y^2 - 4my - 4 = 0$。\\n设 $A(x_1, y_1)$、$B(x_2, y_2)$，则 $y_1 y_2 = -4$。\\n又 $x_1 = \\\\frac{y_1^2}{4}$，$x_2 = \\\\frac{y_2^2}{4}$，所以 $x_1 x_2 = \\\\frac{(y_1 y_2)^2}{16} = \\\\frac{(-4)^2}{16} = 1$。\\n因此 $\\\\overrightarrow{OA} \\\\cdot \\\\overrightarrow{OB} = x_1 x_2 + y_1 y_2 = 1 + (-4) = -3$，为定值 $-3$。"}', '【得分要点】(1) 准确算焦距 $p=2$ 与焦点弦长 $8$；(2) 用倒斜率设 $x=my+1$ 避免讨论斜率不存在，联立韦达求定值 $-3$。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["抛物线焦点弦与OA·OB定值","手写解答","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"抛物线焦点与准线示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":26,"y1":108,"x2":294,"y2":108,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"arrow","x1":112,"y1":194,"x2":112,"y2":18,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":284,"y":114,"text":"x","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":119,"y":16,"text":"y","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":99,"y":113,"text":"O","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"polyline","points":[[249.5,184],[238.3,180.8],[227.6,177.7],[217.3,174.5],[207.5,171.3],[198.2,168.2],[189.4,165],[181,161.8],[173.1,158.7],[165.7,155.5],[158.8,152.3],[152.3,149.2],[146.4,146],[140.9,142.8],[135.9,139.7],[131.3,136.5],[127.3,133.3],[123.7,130.2],[120.6,127],[118,123.8],[115.8,120.7],[114.1,117.5],[113,114.3],[112.2,111.2],[112,108],[112.2,104.8],[113,101.7],[114.1,98.5],[115.8,95.3],[118,92.2],[120.6,89],[123.7,85.8],[127.3,82.7],[131.3,79.5],[135.9,76.3],[140.9,73.2],[146.4,70],[152.3,66.8],[158.8,63.7],[165.7,60.5],[173.1,57.3],[181,54.2],[189.4,51],[198.2,47.8],[207.5,44.7],[217.3,41.5],[227.6,38.3],[238.3,35.2],[249.5,32]],"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"line","x1":84,"y1":24,"x2":84,"y2":190,"color":"#DC2626","dashed":true},{"type":"point","x":140,"y":108,"label":"F","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":56,"y":28,"text":"准线 l","color":"#DC2626"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 105, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
