SELECT 'h2', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '设等比数列 $\\{a_n\\}$ 的前 $n$ 项和为 $S_n$，若 $\\frac{S_6}{S_3} = 3$，则 $\\frac{S_9}{S_6} =$（  ）', '["$\\\\frac{7}{3}$","$3$","$4$","$2$"]', '{"index":0}', '设 $S_3 = m$，则 $S_6 - S_3 = 2m$。由等比片段和成等比：$m, 2m, 4m$，故 $S_9 = m + 2m + 4m = 7m$，所以 $\\frac{S_9}{S_6} = \\frac{7m}{3m} = \\frac{7}{3}$。', NULL, NULL, 3, '["等比片段和性质","TASK-20261122-002"]', NULL, 'ADMIN', 1, 102, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
