SELECT 'h2', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '已知数列 $\\{a_n\\}$ 满足 $a_1 = 1$，$a_{n+1} = 2a_n + 1$，则该数列的通项公式为（  ）', '["$a_n = 2^n - 1$","$a_n = 2^n + 1$","$a_n = 2^{n-1}$","$a_n = 3\\\\cdot 2^{n-1} - 2$"]', '{"index":0}', '构造法：$a_{n+1} + 1 = 2(a_n + 1)$，首项 $a_1 + 1 = 2$，公比 $2$，故 $a_n + 1 = 2^n \\Rightarrow a_n = 2^n - 1$。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["构造等比数列求通项","TASK-20261122-002"]', NULL, 'ADMIN', 1, 101, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
