SELECT 'h2', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '已知正项数列 $\\{a_n\\}$ 的前 $n$ 项和 $S_n$ 满足 $4S_n = (a_n + 1)^2$，则 $a_n =$（  ）', '["$2n - 1$","$2n + 1$","$n$","$n^2$"]', '{"index":0}', '当 $n=1$ 时，$4a_1 = (a_1+1)^2 \\Rightarrow (a_1-1)^2=0 \\Rightarrow a_1=1$；作差 $4a_n = (a_n+1)^2 - (a_{n-1}+1)^2 \\Rightarrow (a_n+a_{n-1})(a_n - a_{n-1} - 2) = 0$，因正项得公差为 $2$，$a_n = 2n - 1$。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["Sn与an二次递推作差","TASK-20261122-002"]', NULL, 'ADMIN', 1, 102, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
