SELECT 'h2', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '已知函数 $f(x) = x^3 + ax^2 + x + 1$ 在 $R$ 上单调递增，则实数 $a$ 的取值范围是（  ）', '["$[-\\\\sqrt{3}, \\\\sqrt{3}]$","$(-\\\\sqrt{3}, \\\\sqrt{3})$","$[-3, 3]$","$(-\\\\infty, -\\\\sqrt{3}] \\\\cup [\\\\sqrt{3}, +\\\\infty)$"]', '{"index":0}', '导数 $f\'(x) = 3x^2 + 2ax + 1 \\ge 0$ 在 $R$ 上恒成立，即 $\\Delta = 4a^2 - 12 \\le 0 \\Rightarrow a^2 \\le 3 \\Rightarrow -\\sqrt{3} \\le a \\le \\sqrt{3}$（端点等号时导数仅在一点为零，仍严格单调递增）。', NULL, NULL, 3, '["导数恒单调求参","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"导数与函数单调性/极值示意","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":26,"y1":114,"x2":294,"y2":114,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"arrow","x1":148,"y1":194,"x2":148,"y2":18,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":284,"y":120,"text":"x","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":155,"y":16,"text":"y","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":135,"y":119,"text":"O","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"polyline","points":[[68.1,151.7],[71.9,140.4],[75.7,130.4],[79.5,121.8],[83.3,114.4],[87.1,108.2],[90.9,103.2],[94.7,99.1],[98.5,96.1],[102.3,94],[106.1,92.7],[110,92.2],[113.8,92.4],[117.6,93.2],[121.4,94.6],[125.2,96.4],[129,98.7],[132.8,101.4],[136.6,104.3],[140.4,107.4],[144.2,110.7],[148,114],[151.8,117.3],[155.6,120.6],[159.4,123.7],[163.2,126.6],[167,129.3],[170.8,131.6],[174.6,133.4],[178.4,134.8],[182.2,135.6],[186,135.8],[189.9,135.3],[193.7,134],[197.5,131.9],[201.3,128.9],[205.1,124.8],[208.9,119.8],[212.7,113.6],[216.5,106.2],[220.3,97.6],[224.1,87.6],[227.9,76.3]],"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"line","x1":90.6,"y1":92.16,"x2":130.6,"y2":92.16,"color":"#DC2626","dashed":true},{"type":"line","x1":165.4,"y1":135.84,"x2":205.4,"y2":135.84,"color":"#059669","dashed":true},{"type":"point","x":110.6,"y":92.16,"label":"极大值","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":185.4,"y":135.84,"label":"极小值","color":"#059669"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 101, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
