SELECT 'h2', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'DYNAMIC_TEMPLATE', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '计算乘积导数：设 $f(x) = (x - {{k}})e^x$，则 $f\'(x) = 0$ 的根是 $x =$（  ）', '[]', '{"index":0}', '由乘积求导公式：$f\'(x) = 1\\cdot e^x + (x - {{k}})e^x = (x - {{k}} + 1)e^x$，令其为 $0$ 得 $x = {{k-1}}$。', NULL, '{"type":"PARAM_TEMPLATE","vars":{"k":[2,6]},"stemTpl":"计算乘积导数：设 $f(x) = (x - {{k}})e^x$，则 $f\'(x) = 0$ 的根是 $x =$（  ）","ansExpr":"k - 1","wrongExprs":["k + 1","k","-k"]}', 3, '["乘积求导零点","TASK-20261122-002"]', NULL, 'ADMIN', 1, 103, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
