SELECT 'h2', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '过坐标原点作曲线 $y = e^x$ 的切线，则该切线的斜率是（  ）', '["$e$","$1$","$\\\\frac{1}{e}$","$2e$"]', '{"index":0}', '因为原点不在曲线上，设切点为 $(x_0, e^{x_0})$，则切线方程为 $y - e^{x_0} = e^{x_0}(x - x_0)$。代入 $(0, 0)$ 得 $-e^{x_0} = -x_0 e^{x_0} \\Rightarrow x_0 = 1$，故切线斜率为 $e^1 = e$。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["过曲线外一点求切线","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"过原点作 y = e^x 的切线","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":26,"y1":164,"x2":294,"y2":164,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"arrow","x1":112,"y1":194,"x2":112,"y2":18,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":284,"y":170,"text":"x","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":119,"y":16,"text":"y","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":99,"y":169,"text":"O","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"polyline","points":[[35.2,158.3],[39.6,157.8],[44.1,157.2],[48.5,156.5],[53,155.8],[57.4,155],[61.9,154.1],[66.3,153.2],[70.8,152.1],[75.2,151],[79.7,149.7],[84.1,148.3],[88.6,146.8],[93,145.1],[97.5,143.3],[101.9,141.3],[106.4,139.1],[110.8,136.7],[115.2,134],[119.7,131.1],[124.1,127.9],[128.6,124.4],[133,120.6],[137.5,116.4],[141.9,111.8],[146.4,106.7],[150.8,101.1],[155.3,95],[159.7,88.3],[164.2,81],[168.6,72.9],[173.1,64.1],[177.5,54.4],[182,43.8],[186.4,32.1]],"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"line","x1":102.4,"y1":179.12,"x2":196,"y2":30.72,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":160,"y":87.88810880314674,"label":"切点","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":204,"y":38,"text":"y = e^x","color":"#0284C7"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 101, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
