SELECT 'h2', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '已知随机变量 $\\xi$ 服从正态分布 $N(100, 10^2)$，附：$P(\\mu-\\sigma < \\xi \\le \\mu+\\sigma) \\approx 0.6827$，$P(\\mu-2\\sigma < \\xi \\le \\mu+2\\sigma) \\approx 0.9545$。若从总体中随机抽测一次，结果落在 $(110, 120]$ 区间内的概率约为（  ）', '["$0.1359$","$0.2718$","$0.6827$","$0.0455$"]', '{"index":0}', '由对称性 $P(110 < \\xi \\le 120) = \\frac{1}{2}[P(80 < \\xi \\le 120) - P(90 < \\xi \\le 110)] \\approx \\frac{0.9545 - 0.6827}{2} = 0.1359$。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["正态分布3σ原则","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"正态分布 N(100, 10²) 与区间 (110,120]","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":26,"y1":164,"x2":294,"y2":164,"color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"polygon","points":[[202,164],[202,93.6],[205.5,99.5],[209,105.3],[212.5,110.9],[216,116.3],[219.5,121.5],[223,126.3],[226.5,130.9],[230,135.1],[233.5,138.9],[237,142.4],[240.5,145.5],[244,148.3],[244,164]],"color":"#D97706","fillColor":"#FBBF24"},{"type":"polyline","points":[[42.4,161.7],[47.7,160.7],[53.1,159.5],[58.4,157.8],[63.8,155.6],[69.1,152.8],[74.5,149.4],[79.8,145.2],[85.2,140.3],[90.5,134.5],[95.9,127.9],[101.2,120.5],[106.5,112.4],[111.9,103.8],[117.2,94.9],[122.6,86],[127.9,77.3],[133.3,69.3],[138.6,62.1],[144,56.2],[149.3,51.7],[154.7,48.9],[160,48],[165.3,48.9],[170.7,51.7],[176,56.2],[181.4,62.1],[186.7,69.3],[192.1,77.3],[197.4,86],[202.8,94.9],[208.1,103.8],[213.5,112.4],[218.8,120.5],[224.1,127.9],[229.5,134.5],[234.8,140.3],[240.2,145.2],[245.5,149.4],[250.9,152.8],[256.2,155.6],[261.6,157.8],[266.9,159.5],[272.3,160.7],[277.6,161.7]],"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"line","x1":160,"y1":34,"x2":160,"y2":164,"color":"#DC2626","dashed":true},{"type":"text","x":144,"y":18,"text":"μ=100","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":112,"y":172,"text":"90","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":150,"y":172,"text":"100","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":194,"y":172,"text":"110","color":"#D97706"},{"type":"text","x":236,"y":172,"text":"120","color":"#D97706"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 101, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
