SELECT 'h2', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '已知残差平方和越小，线性回归模型的拟合效果越（  ），且决定系数 $R^2$ 越接近于（  ）', '["好，$1$","好，$0$","差，$1$","差，$0$"]', '{"index":0}', '残差平方和 $\\sum (y_i - \\hat{y}_i)^2$ 越小说明误差越小、拟合效果越好，对应决定系数 $R^2 = 1 - \\frac{\\sum (y_i-\\hat{y}_i)^2}{\\sum (y_i-\\bar{y})^2}$ 越接近 $1$。', NULL, NULL, 2, '["决定系数R方与残差","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"线性回归散点与残差示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":24,"y1":172,"x2":294,"y2":172,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"arrow","x1":46,"y1":194,"x2":46,"y2":18,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":284,"y":178,"text":"x","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":53,"y":16,"text":"y","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":33,"y":177,"text":"O","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"line","x1":58,"y1":160,"x2":276,"y2":40,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":76,"y":152,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":114,"y":128,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":154,"y":108,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":194,"y":80,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":234,"y":62,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":264,"y":44,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"line","x1":194,"y1":80,"x2":194,"y2":86,"color":"#D97706"},{"type":"point","x":168,"y":99,"label":"(x̄,ȳ)","color":"#059669"},{"type":"text","x":204,"y":34,"text":"ŷ = bx + a","color":"#DC2626"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 102, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
