SELECT 'h2', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'DYNAMIC_TEMPLATE', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '已知非线性模型 $y = c e^{kx}$ 可通过两边取自然对数转化为线性回归方程 $\\mathrm{ln}\\,y = kx + \\mathrm{ln}\\,c$。若拟合得到 $\\mathrm{ln}\\,y = 0.5x + {{m}}$，则当 $x = 4$ 时，对应的 $\\mathrm{ln}\\,y$ 预报值为（  ）', '[]', '{"index":0}', '将 $x = 4$ 代入线性方程：$\\mathrm{ln}\\,y = 0.5 \\times 4 + {{m}} = 2 + {{m}}$。', NULL, '{"type":"PARAM_TEMPLATE","vars":{"m":[2,6]},"stemTpl":"已知非线性模型 $y = c e^{kx}$ 可通过两边取自然对数转化为线性回归方程 $\\\\mathrm{ln}\\\\,y = kx + \\\\mathrm{ln}\\\\,c$。若拟合得到 $\\\\mathrm{ln}\\\\,y = 0.5x + {{m}}$，则当 $x = 4$ 时，对应的 $\\\\mathrm{ln}\\\\,y$ 预报值为（  ）","ansExpr":"m + 2","wrongExprs":["2 * m + 3","m + 4","m + 1"]}', 3, '["非线性化线性回归","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"线性回归散点与残差示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":24,"y1":172,"x2":294,"y2":172,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"arrow","x1":46,"y1":194,"x2":46,"y2":18,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":284,"y":178,"text":"x","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":53,"y":16,"text":"y","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":33,"y":177,"text":"O","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"line","x1":58,"y1":160,"x2":276,"y2":40,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":76,"y":152,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":114,"y":128,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":154,"y":108,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":194,"y":80,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":234,"y":62,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":264,"y":44,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"line","x1":194,"y1":80,"x2":194,"y2":86,"color":"#D97706"},{"type":"point","x":168,"y":99,"label":"(x̄,ȳ)","color":"#059669"},{"type":"text","x":204,"y":34,"text":"ŷ = bx + a","color":"#DC2626"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 103, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
