SELECT 'h2', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '在成对样本数据 $(x_i, y_i)$ 中，如果将每一个 $y_i$ 都乘以 $-2$ 再加上 $5$（$x_i$ 不变），则新样本的相关系数 $r\'$ 与原相关系数 $r$ 的关系是（  ）', '["$r\' = -r$","$r\' = r$","$r\' = -2r$","$r\' = 2r$"]', '{"index":0}', '相关系数具有尺度与平移不变性（乘负号使方向相反），故乘 $-2$ 加 $5$ 后仅反号：$r\' = -r$。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["相关系数线性变换","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"线性回归散点与残差示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":24,"y1":172,"x2":294,"y2":172,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"arrow","x1":46,"y1":194,"x2":46,"y2":18,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":284,"y":178,"text":"x","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":53,"y":16,"text":"y","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":33,"y":177,"text":"O","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"line","x1":58,"y1":160,"x2":276,"y2":40,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":76,"y":152,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":114,"y":128,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":154,"y":108,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":194,"y":80,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":234,"y":62,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":264,"y":44,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"line","x1":194,"y1":80,"x2":194,"y2":86,"color":"#D97706"},{"type":"point","x":168,"y":99,"label":"(x̄,ȳ)","color":"#059669"},{"type":"text","x":204,"y":34,"text":"ŷ = bx + a","color":"#DC2626"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 101, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
