SELECT 'h2', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '在对 $5$ 个点进行线性回归分析时，剔除一个明显偏离直线的异常离群点后，通常会出现的变化是（  ）', '["决定系数 $R^2$ 变大，残差平方和变小","决定系数 $R^2$ 变小，残差平方和变大","相关系数 $|r|$ 变小","拟合效果一定变差"]', '{"index":0}', '剔除离群点后残差显著减少，残差平方和变小，模型的拟合优度决定系数 $R^2$ 增大（$|r|$ 也增大更接近 $1$）。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["离群点剔除对拟合优度影响","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"线性回归散点与残差示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":24,"y1":172,"x2":294,"y2":172,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"arrow","x1":46,"y1":194,"x2":46,"y2":18,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":284,"y":178,"text":"x","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":53,"y":16,"text":"y","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":33,"y":177,"text":"O","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"line","x1":58,"y1":160,"x2":276,"y2":40,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":76,"y":152,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":114,"y":128,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":154,"y":108,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":194,"y":80,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":234,"y":62,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":264,"y":44,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"line","x1":194,"y1":80,"x2":194,"y2":86,"color":"#D97706"},{"type":"point","x":168,"y":99,"label":"(x̄,ȳ)","color":"#059669"},{"type":"text","x":204,"y":34,"text":"ŷ = bx + a","color":"#DC2626"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 102, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
