SELECT 'h3', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '已知函数 $f(x) = \\mathrm{ln}\\,(x + \\sqrt{x^2 + 1})$，若 $f(2) = a$，则 $f(-2)$ 的值为（  ）', '["$a$","$-a$","$\\\\frac{1}{a}$","$2a$"]', '{"index":1}', '因为 $f(-x) = \\mathrm{ln}\\,(-x + \\sqrt{x^2 + 1}) = \\mathrm{ln}\\,\\frac{1}{x + \\sqrt{x^2 + 1}} = -f(x)$，所以 $f(x)$ 是奇函数，故 $f(-2) = -f(2) = -a$。', NULL, NULL, 1, '["奇函数性质","对数恒等变形","TASK-20261122-002"]', NULL, 'ADMIN', 1, 101, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
