SELECT 'h3', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '已知函数 $f(x) = \\frac{e^x}{x}$（$x \\neq 0$），若方程 $f(x) = k$ 恰好有两个不同的实数根，则实数 $k$ 的取值范围是（  ）', '["$(e, +\\\\infty)$","$(0, e)$","$(-\\\\infty, 0) \\\\cup (e, +\\\\infty)$","$[e, +\\\\infty)$"]', '{"index":0}', '求导得 $f\'(x) = \\frac{e^x(x - 1)}{x^2}$。当 $x < 0$ 时 $f(x) < 0$ 且单调递减，取值范围 $(-\\infty, 0)$；当 $x > 0$ 时 $f(x)$ 在 $(0, 1)$ 递减、$(1, +\\infty)$ 递增，最小值为 $f(1) = e$。因此直线 $y = k$ 与 $y = f(x)$ 恰有 $2$ 个交点当且仅当 $k > e$。', NULL, NULL, 3, '["导数图像与零点个数","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"f(x) = e^x / x 图象与 y = k 交点","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":26,"y1":126,"x2":294,"y2":126,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"arrow","x1":128,"y1":194,"x2":128,"y2":18,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":284,"y":132,"text":"x","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":135,"y":16,"text":"y","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":115,"y":131,"text":"O","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"polyline","points":[[137.5,33.6],[140,47.9],[142.5,57],[145,63.2],[147.6,67.5],[150.1,70.6],[152.6,72.9],[155.1,74.5],[157.6,75.6],[160.1,76.4],[162.6,76.9],[165.2,77.1],[167.7,77],[170.2,76.8],[172.7,76.4],[175.2,75.8],[177.7,75.1],[180.3,74.2],[182.8,73.2],[185.3,72.1],[187.8,70.8],[190.3,69.4],[192.8,67.9],[195.3,66.2],[197.9,64.5],[200.4,62.5],[202.9,60.5],[205.4,58.3],[207.9,55.9],[210.4,53.4],[212.9,50.7],[215.5,47.9],[218,44.9],[220.5,41.7],[223,38.3]],"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"polyline","points":[[33,126.6],[35.9,126.7],[38.8,126.7],[41.7,126.8],[44.6,126.9],[47.4,127],[50.3,127.1],[53.2,127.3],[56.1,127.4],[59,127.6],[61.9,127.8],[64.8,128],[67.7,128.3],[70.5,128.6],[73.4,129],[76.3,129.4],[79.2,129.9],[82.1,130.5],[85,131.1],[87.9,131.9],[90.8,132.9],[93.6,134.1],[96.5,135.5],[99.4,137.3],[102.3,139.5],[105.2,142.5],[108.1,146.3],[111,151.7],[113.9,159.4],[116.8,171.2],[119.6,191.7]],"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"line","x1":34,"y1":61.2,"x2":286,"y2":61.2,"color":"#DC2626","dashed":true},{"type":"point","x":166,"y":77.07092708773719,"label":"(1,e)","color":"#059669"},{"type":"text","x":224,"y":45.2,"text":"y = k","color":"#DC2626"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 101, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
