SELECT 'h3', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '已知抛物线 $C: y^2 = 12x$ 的焦点为 $F$，点 $P(x_0, y_0)$ 在抛物线 $C$ 上，若 $|PF| = 7$，则 $x_0$ 的值为（  ）', '["$3$","$4$","$5$","$6$"]', '{"index":1}', '由 $2p = 12$ 得 $\\frac{p}{2} = 3$，利用抛物线焦半径公式 $|PF| = x_0 + \\frac{p}{2} = x_0 + 3 = 7$，解得 $x_0 = 4$。', NULL, NULL, 1, '["抛物线焦半径","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"抛物线焦点与准线示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":26,"y1":108,"x2":294,"y2":108,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"arrow","x1":112,"y1":194,"x2":112,"y2":18,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":284,"y":114,"text":"x","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":119,"y":16,"text":"y","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":99,"y":113,"text":"O","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"polyline","points":[[249.5,184],[238.3,180.8],[227.6,177.7],[217.3,174.5],[207.5,171.3],[198.2,168.2],[189.4,165],[181,161.8],[173.1,158.7],[165.7,155.5],[158.8,152.3],[152.3,149.2],[146.4,146],[140.9,142.8],[135.9,139.7],[131.3,136.5],[127.3,133.3],[123.7,130.2],[120.6,127],[118,123.8],[115.8,120.7],[114.1,117.5],[113,114.3],[112.2,111.2],[112,108],[112.2,104.8],[113,101.7],[114.1,98.5],[115.8,95.3],[118,92.2],[120.6,89],[123.7,85.8],[127.3,82.7],[131.3,79.5],[135.9,76.3],[140.9,73.2],[146.4,70],[152.3,66.8],[158.8,63.7],[165.7,60.5],[173.1,57.3],[181,54.2],[189.4,51],[198.2,47.8],[207.5,44.7],[217.3,41.5],[227.6,38.3],[238.3,35.2],[249.5,32]],"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"line","x1":84,"y1":24,"x2":84,"y2":190,"color":"#DC2626","dashed":true},{"type":"point","x":140,"y":108,"label":"F","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":56,"y":28,"text":"准线 l","color":"#DC2626"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 101, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
