SELECT 'h3', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '已知定圆 $C_1: (x + 3)^2 + y^2 = 1$ 与 $C_2: (x - 3)^2 + y^2 = 81$，若动圆 $M$ 与圆 $C_1$ 外切且内切于圆 $C_2$，则动圆圆心 $M$ 的轨迹是（  ）', '["双曲线的一支","椭圆","圆","抛物线"]', '{"index":1}', '设动圆 $M$ 的半径为 $R$，由相切条件得 $|MC_1| = R + 1$，$|MC_2| = 9 - R$，两式相加得 $|MC_1| + |MC_2| = 10 > |C_1C_2| = 6$，由椭圆定义知轨迹为椭圆。', NULL, NULL, 3, '["相切圆轨迹定义","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"直线与圆的位置关系示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"circle","cx":138,"cy":108,"r":62,"color":"#1E293B","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"line","x1":138,"y1":108,"x2":186,"y2":68,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"line","x1":72,"y1":30,"x2":266,"y2":176,"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"rightAngle","vx":186,"vy":68,"ax":138,"ay":108,"bx":266,"by":176,"size":9,"color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":138,"y":108,"label":"C","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":158,"y":76,"text":"d","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"text","x":244,"y":148,"text":"l","color":"#0284C7"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 102, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
