SELECT 'h3', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'ESSAY', '已知椭圆 $C: \\frac{x^2}{a^2} + \\frac{y^2}{b^2} = 1$（$a > b > 0$）的离心率 $e = \\frac{1}{2}$，且长轴长为 $4$。\n(1) 求椭圆 $C$ 的标准方程；\n(2) 过椭圆 $C$ 的右焦点 $F$ 作斜率为 $1$ 的直线 $l$ 交椭圆 $C$ 于 $A, B$ 两点，求弦长 $|AB|$。', '[]', '{"text":"解：\\n(1) 由长轴长 $2a = 4$ 得 $a = 2$，又 $e = \\\\frac{c}{a} = \\\\frac{1}{2}$，所以 $c = 1$，\\n从而 $b^2 = a^2 - c^2 = 4 - 1 = 3$。\\n故椭圆 $C$ 的标准方程为 $\\\\frac{x^2}{4} + \\\\frac{y^2}{3} = 1$。\\n(2) 右焦点为 $F(1, 0)$，直线 $l$ 的方程为 $y = x - 1$。\\n联立 $\\\\begin{cases} y = x - 1 \\\\\\\\ 3x^2 + 4y^2 = 12 \\\\end{cases}$，消去 $y$ 得 $3x^2 + 4(x - 1)^2 = 12$，\\n化简为 $7x^2 - 8x - 8 = 0$（$\\\\Delta = 64 + 224 = 288 > 0$）。\\n设 $A(x_1, y_1)$、$B(x_2, y_2)$，则 $x_1 + x_2 = \\\\frac{8}{7}$，$x_1 x_2 = -\\\\frac{8}{7}$。\\n弦长 $|AB| = \\\\sqrt{1 + 1^2} \\\\cdot \\\\sqrt{(x_1 + x_2)^2 - 4x_1 x_2} = \\\\sqrt{2} \\\\cdot \\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{288}}{7} = \\\\frac{24}{7}$。"}', '【得分要点】(1) 准确由 $2a, e$ 算出 $a^2=4, b^2=3$；(2) 联立方程用韦达定理与弦长公式 $\\sqrt{1+k^2}|x_1-x_2|$ 算得 $\\frac{24}{7}$。', NULL, NULL, 3, '["椭圆方程与弦长公式","手写解答","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"椭圆焦点与标准方程示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"arrow","x1":24,"y1":108,"x2":296,"y2":108,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"arrow","x1":160,"y1":194,"x2":160,"y2":18,"color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":286,"y":114,"text":"x","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":167,"y":16,"text":"y","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"text","x":147,"y":113,"text":"O","color":"#64748B"},{"type":"polyline","points":[[256,108],[255.2,115.3],[252.7,122.5],[248.7,129.4],[243.1,136],[236.2,142.1],[227.9,147.6],[218.4,152.4],[208,156.5],[196.7,159.7],[184.8,162.1],[172.5,163.5],[160,164],[147.5,163.5],[135.2,162.1],[123.3,159.7],[112,156.5],[101.6,152.4],[92.1,147.6],[83.8,142.1],[76.9,136],[71.3,129.4],[67.3,122.5],[64.8,115.3],[64,108],[64.8,100.7],[67.3,93.5],[71.3,86.6],[76.9,80],[83.8,73.9],[92.1,68.4],[101.6,63.6],[112,59.5],[123.3,56.3],[135.2,53.9],[147.5,52.5],[160,52],[172.5,52.5],[184.8,53.9],[196.7,56.3],[208,59.5],[218.4,63.6],[227.9,68.4],[236.2,73.9],[243.1,80],[248.7,86.6],[252.7,93.5],[255.2,100.7],[256,108]],"color":"#0284C7"},{"type":"point","x":82,"y":108,"label":"F₁","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":238,"y":108,"label":"F₂","color":"#DC2626"},{"type":"point","x":202,"y":58,"label":"P","color":"#059669"},{"type":"line","x1":82,"y1":108,"x2":202,"y2":58,"color":"#059669","dashed":true},{"type":"line","x1":238,"y1":108,"x2":202,"y2":58,"color":"#059669","dashed":true}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 104, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
