SELECT 'h3', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '已知随机变量 $X \\sim B(10, p)$，且 $E(X) = 4$，则 $D(2X - 1)$ 的值为（  ）', '["$2.4$","$4.8$","$8.6$","$9.6$"]', '{"index":3}', '由 $E(X) = 10p = 4$ 得 $p = 0.4$，从而 $D(X) = 10 \\times 0.4 \\times 0.6 = 2.4$，故 $D(2X - 1) = 4D(X) = 9.6$。', NULL, NULL, 3, '["二项分布方差与线性性质","TASK-20261122-002"]', NULL, 'ADMIN', 1, 101, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
