SELECT 'h3', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '在 $\\triangle ABC$ 中，内角 $A, B, C$ 的对边分别为 $a, b, c$。已知 $a = 2$，$b = 2\\sqrt{3}$，$A = 30^\\circ$，则角 $B$ 的值为（  ）', '["$60^\\\\circ$","$120^\\\\circ$","$60^\\\\circ$ 或 $120^\\\\circ$","$45^\\\\circ$ 或 $135^\\\\circ$"]', '{"index":2}', '由正弦定理 $\\frac{a}{\\mathrm{sin}\\,A} = \\frac{b}{\\mathrm{sin}\\,B}$ 得 $\\mathrm{sin}\\,B = \\frac{2\\sqrt{3} \\times \\frac{1}{2}}{2} = \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$。因为 $b > a$，所以 $B > 30^\\circ$，且 $60^\\circ$ 与 $120^\\circ$ 均满足 $A + B < 180^\\circ$，故 $B = 60^\\circ$ 或 $120^\\circ$。', NULL, NULL, 1, '["正弦定理多解讨论","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"△ABC 示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"polygon","points":[[148,32],[56,172],[264,172]],"color":"#1E293B","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"text","x":142,"y":12,"text":"A","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":40,"y":174,"text":"B","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":268,"y":174,"text":"C","color":"#1E293B"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 101, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
