SELECT 'h3', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'DYNAMIC_TEMPLATE', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '已知等比数列 $\\{a_n\\}$ 的前 $n$ 项和为 $S_n$，若 $S_4 = 3$，$S_8 = {{3 * (q + 1)}}$，则 $S_{12}$ 等于（  ）', '[]', '{"index":0}', '由片段和成等比性质，$S_4, S_8 - S_4, S_{12} - S_8$ 成等比数列。这里 $S_4 = 3$，$S_8 - S_4 = 3\\times {{q}}$，公比为 ${{q}}$，故 $S_{12} - S_8 = 3\\times {{q}}^2$，相加得 $S_{12} = {{3*q*q + 3*q + 3}}$。', NULL, '{"type":"PARAM_TEMPLATE","vars":{"q":[2,4]},"stemTpl":"已知等比数列 $\\\\{a_n\\\\}$ 的前 $n$ 项和为 $S_n$，若 $S_4 = 3$，$S_8 = {{3 * (q + 1)}}$，则 $S_{12}$ 等于（  ）","ansExpr":"3 * q * q + 3 * q + 3","wrongExprs":["3 * q * q + 3 * q","3 * q * q + 3","3 * q * q + 6 * q + 3"]}', 1, '["等比数列片段和性质","TASK-20261122-002"]', NULL, 'ADMIN', 1, 104, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
