SELECT 'h3', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '在 $\\triangle ABC$ 中，内角 $A, B, C$ 的对边分别为 $a, b, c$。若 $(2b - c)\\mathrm{cos}\\,A = a\\mathrm{cos}\\,C$，则角 $A$ 的大小为（  ）', '["$\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}$","$\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{4}$","$\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}$","$\\\\frac{2\\\\pi}{3}$"]', '{"index":2}', '由正弦定理边化角得 $(2\\mathrm{sin}\\,B - \\mathrm{sin}\\,C)\\mathrm{cos}\\,A = \\mathrm{sin}\\,A\\mathrm{cos}\\,C$，移项合并得 $2\\mathrm{sin}\\,B\\mathrm{cos}\\,A = \\mathrm{sin}\\,(A + C) = \\mathrm{sin}\\,B$。因 $\\mathrm{sin}\\,B > 0$，得 $\\mathrm{cos}\\,A = \\frac{1}{2}$，故 $A = \\frac{\\pi}{3}$。', NULL, NULL, 2, '["正弦定理边角互化","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"△ABC 示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"polygon","points":[[148,32],[56,172],[264,172]],"color":"#1E293B","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"text","x":142,"y":12,"text":"A","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":40,"y":174,"text":"B","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":268,"y":174,"text":"C","color":"#1E293B"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 101, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
