SELECT 'h3', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '在数列 $\\{a_n\\}$ 中，已知 $a_1 = 1$，$a_{n+1} = 2a_n + 3$（$n \\in N^*$），则通项公式 $a_n =$（  ）', '["$2^n - 1$","$2^{n+1} - 3$","$3 \\\\cdot 2^{n-1} - 2$","$2^n + 1$"]', '{"index":1}', '构造等比数列：$a_{n+1} + 3 = 2(a_n + 3)$，首项 $a_1 + 3 = 4$，公比为 $2$，故 $a_n + 3 = 4 \\cdot 2^{n-1} = 2^{n+1}$，即 $a_n = 2^{n+1} - 3$。', NULL, NULL, 2, '["构造等比求通项","TASK-20261122-002"]', NULL, 'ADMIN', 1, 102, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
