SELECT 'h3', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '已知数列 $\\{a_n\\}$ 的通项公式为 $a_n = \\frac{1}{n(n + 2)}$（$n \\in N^*$），前 $n$ 项和为 $S_n$，则 $S_4$ 的值为（  ）', '["$\\\\frac{17}{30}$","$\\\\frac{4}{5}$","$\\\\frac{7}{15}$","$\\\\frac{17}{15}$"]', '{"index":0}', '裂项得 $a_n = \\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\frac{1}{n} - \\frac{1}{n + 2}\\right)$，故 $S_4 = \\frac{1}{2}\\left(1 + \\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{1}{5} - \\frac{1}{6}\\right) = \\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{17}{15} = \\frac{17}{30}$。', NULL, NULL, 3, '["隔项裂项相消","TASK-20261122-002"]', NULL, 'ADMIN', 1, 101, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
