SELECT 'h3', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '在 $\\triangle ABC$ 中，内角 $A, B, C$ 所对的边分别为 $a, b, c$，若 $C = \\frac{\\pi}{3}$ 且 $c = \\sqrt{3}$，则 $\\triangle ABC$ 外接圆的面积为（  ）', '["$\\\\frac{\\\\pi}{2}$","$\\\\pi$","$2\\\\pi$","$4\\\\pi$"]', '{"index":1}', '由正弦定理 $2R = \\frac{c}{\\mathrm{sin}\\,C} = \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{\\sqrt{3}/2} = 2$，得外接圆半径 $R = 1$，故面积 $S = \\pi R^2 = \\pi$。', NULL, NULL, 3, '["外接圆半径正弦定理","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"△ABC 示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"polygon","points":[[148,32],[56,172],[264,172]],"color":"#1E293B","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"text","x":142,"y":12,"text":"A","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":40,"y":174,"text":"B","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":268,"y":174,"text":"C","color":"#1E293B"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 102, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
