SELECT 'h3', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'ESSAY', '在 $\\triangle ABC$ 中，内角 $A, B, C$ 的对边分别为 $a, b, c$，已知 $\\sqrt{3}a\\mathrm{sin}\\,C + a\\mathrm{cos}\\,C = b + c$。\n(1) 求角 $A$ 的大小；\n(2) 若 $a = \\sqrt{7}$，$c = 2$，求 $\\triangle ABC$ 的面积。', '[]', '{"text":"解：\\n(1) 由正弦定理将边化角，得 $\\\\sqrt{3}\\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,A\\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,C + \\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,A\\\\mathrm{cos}\\\\,C = \\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,B + \\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,C$。\\n将 $\\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,B = \\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,(A + C) = \\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,A\\\\mathrm{cos}\\\\,C + \\\\mathrm{cos}\\\\,A\\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,C$ 代入并消去 $\\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,A\\\\mathrm{cos}\\\\,C$：\\n$\\\\sqrt{3}\\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,A\\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,C = \\\\mathrm{cos}\\\\,A\\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,C + \\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,C$。\\n因为 $C \\\\in (0, \\\\pi)$，所以 $\\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,C > 0$，两边同除以 $\\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,C$ 得 $\\\\sqrt{3}\\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,A - \\\\mathrm{cos}\\\\,A = 1$，\\n即 $2\\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,\\\\left(A - \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}\\\\right) = 1 \\\\Rightarrow \\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,\\\\left(A - \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}\\\\right) = \\\\frac{1}{2}$。\\n又 $A \\\\in (0, \\\\pi)$，故 $A - \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6} = \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{6}$，解得 $A = \\\\frac{\\\\pi}{3}$。\\n(2) 由余弦定理 $a^2 = b^2 + c^2 - 2bc\\\\mathrm{cos}\\\\,A$ 得 $7 = b^2 + 4 - 2b$，\\n即 $b^2 - 2b - 3 = 0$，解得 $b = 3$（舍去负根 $b = -1$）。\\n所以 $\\\\triangle ABC$ 的面积 $S = \\\\frac{1}{2}bc\\\\mathrm{sin}\\\\,A = \\\\frac{1}{2} \\\\times 3 \\\\times 2 \\\\times \\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{3}}{2} = \\\\frac{3\\\\sqrt{3}}{2}$。"}', '【得分要点】(1) 正弦化角后用辅助角公式精准求得 $A = \\frac{\\pi}{3}$；(2) 用余弦定理列方程求出 $b = 3$ 并代面积公式得 $\\frac{3\\sqrt{3}}{2}$。', NULL, NULL, 3, '["解三角形正余弦定理综合","手写解答","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"△ABC 示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"polygon","points":[[148,32],[56,172],[264,172]],"color":"#1E293B","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"text","x":142,"y":12,"text":"A","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":40,"y":174,"text":"B","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":268,"y":174,"text":"C","color":"#1E293B"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 104, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
