SELECT 'h3', @ch_id, @gt_id, 'STATIC', 'SINGLE_CHOICE', '在 $\\triangle ABC$ 中，已知 $A = 120^\\circ$，$b = 3$，$c = 6$，$AD$ 是 $\\angle BAC$ 的平分线并交 $BC$ 于点 $D$，则线段 $AD$ 的长为（  ）', '["$1$","$2$","$\\\\frac{3}{2}$","$3$"]', '{"index":1}', '由等面积法 $S_{\\triangle ABC} = S_{\\triangle ABD} + S_{\\triangle ACD}$ 得 $\\frac{1}{2}bc\\mathrm{sin}\\,120^\\circ = \\frac{1}{2}(b + c)AD\\cdot\\mathrm{sin}\\,60^\\circ$，因 $\\mathrm{sin}\\,120^\\circ = \\mathrm{sin}\\,60^\\circ$，故 $AD = \\frac{bc}{b + c} = \\frac{3\\times 6}{3 + 6} = 2$。', NULL, NULL, 4, '["三角形角平分线等面积法","TASK-20261122-002"]', '{"diagram":{"title":"△ABC 示意图","width":320,"height":210,"primitives":[{"type":"polygon","points":[[148,32],[56,172],[264,172]],"color":"#1E293B","fillColor":"#38BDF8"},{"type":"text","x":142,"y":12,"text":"A","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":40,"y":174,"text":"B","color":"#1E293B"},{"type":"text","x":268,"y":174,"text":"C","color":"#1E293B"}]}}', 'ADMIN', 1, 101, 1, NULL, 0 FROM DUAL
